	quest.B0070D41829BF922.title: "Подготовить резерв финала"
	quest.B0070D41829BF922.quest_desc: [
		"Перед Avaritia сохрани запас энергии, процессоров, сплавов, сердец и ремонтных ресурсов."
		"After completion, identify what this unlocks: a dimension, resource, seal, or technology."
	]
	quest.1815B00F4E685095.title: "Завершить кодекс"
	quest.1815B00F4E685095.quest_desc: [
		"Перечитай пропущенные пояснения и убедись, что понимаешь не только порядок боссов, но и назначение каждого технологического допуска."
		"After completion, identify what this unlocks: a dimension, resource, seal, or technology."
	]
	quest.783974C228C7A863.title: "Смыкание приключений и технологий: understood"
	quest.783974C228C7A863.quest_desc: [
		"You completed the section and understand how it links to later dimensions and technical recipes."
		"Verify a safe return point, backup supplies, and labelled trophy storage."
	]
	quest.A17E4D09B8C2F101.title: "Field Engineering Kit"
	quest.A17E4D09B8C2F101.quest_desc: ["Build the first reliable structural and conductive kit from Immersive Engineering materials, copper and protected glass.","Acceptance: inputs are labelled, no boss drop is consumed, and enough ordinary material remains for at least four additional kits.","This branch establishes manual fabrication before automated machinery is allowed to hide poor preparation."]
	quest.B29F510AC7D3E202.title: "Power Regulation Unit"
	quest.B29F510AC7D3E202.quest_desc: ["Combine redstone control, conductive materials and a Modern Industrialization motor.","Acceptance: the motor supply is repeatable, the energy path is protected, and buffers cover at least three normal crafting cycles.","Power distribution and motion control are independent engineering problems; neither requires Create as the first machine."]
	quest.C3A0621BD8E4F303.title: "Materials Analysis Matrix"
	quest.C3A0621BD8E4F303.quest_desc: ["Prepare the analytical layer from quartz, redstone, glass and comparator logic.","Acceptance: quartz and redstone inputs can support four repeated crafts and the output has dedicated storage.","Later circuits assume that materials are measured and classified instead of guessed."]
	quest.D4B1732CE9F50404.title: "Industrial Kinetic Interface"
	quest.D4B1732CE9F50404.quest_desc: ["Create enters the factory here as a specialized mechanical automation system.","Acceptance: the kinetic network remains below 75% of available stress during the intended workload and can be isolated with a clutch or equivalent control.","Do not compensate for an unstable design by adding shafts blindly; measure stress and speed together."]
	chapter.5E684E5FDC0912E2.title: "Engineering Foundations — Practical Guide"
	quest.2A0768299BEC7CCC.title: "Three Foundations, One Industry"
	quest.2A0768299BEC7CCC.quest_desc: ["This chapter explains the redesigned opening of the expert progression.", "Field engineering, power regulation and materials analysis can be developed in parallel. Create becomes a specialized automation branch after the common mechanical foundation."]
	quest.436B911E8482D562.title: "Field Engineering"
	quest.436B911E8482D562.quest_desc: ["The field kit represents reliable hand fabrication: structural components, copper conductors and protected observation surfaces.", "Keep a small reserve. It is a foundation component, not disposable filler."]
	quest.D9BFE27ABA2A8E46.title: "Regulate Before You Scale"
	quest.D9BFE27ABA2A8E46.quest_desc: ["A motor is useful only when its energy and motion can be controlled.", "This branch joins redstone logic, conductive materials and a Modern Industrialization motor without requiring Create machinery first."]
	quest.B5B36564426EF7E8.title: "Measure the Material"
	quest.B5B36564426EF7E8.quest_desc: ["Quartz, a comparator and redstone form the first analytical layer of the pack.", "The matrix represents measurement and classification. Later circuits assume that materials have already been tested instead of guessed."]
	quest.605660875B4C79AF.title: "Convergence: Mechanical Core"
	quest.605660875B4C79AF.quest_desc: ["The three opening branches meet here.", "The mechanical core is the first shared industrial standard: structural reliability, regulated motion and measured materials in one reusable component."]
	quest.3ED4D6DED8602830.title: "Create Enters the Factory"
	quest.3ED4D6DED8602830.quest_desc: ["Create is now an engineering specialization rather than the compulsory first step.", "The kinetic interface connects andesite mechanics to the common core and prepares machines for the industrial frame."]
	quest.20D0E8E84656635C.title: "Stress Capacity"
	quest.20D0E8E84656635C.quest_desc: ["Create networks fail when total stress impact exceeds available stress capacity.", "Read the network before expanding it. Add generation or split the network instead of hiding an overloaded design behind extra shafts."]
	quest.D0D83BE590660FF8.title: "Speed Is Not Free"
	quest.D0D83BE590660FF8.quest_desc: ["Rotational speed changes throughput, but faster machines usually demand more stress.", "Measure RPM and stress together. A stable slower line is more useful than a fast line that stops under load."]
	quest.B6A47F9FF2C532F8.title: "Ratios and Transmission"
	quest.B6A47F9FF2C532F8.quest_desc: ["Small and large cogwheels change rotational speed when meshed correctly.", "Design ratios around the slowest process, then use clutches, gearshifts or separate branches to prevent one machine from destabilizing the entire factory."]
	quest.C1766C57141D1D5A.title: "Coke Oven Discipline"
	quest.C1766C57141D1D5A.quest_desc: ["Build the complete Immersive Engineering coke-oven shell and verify the multiblock before loading bulk fuel.", "Coke and creosote are both products. Plan storage for the liquid instead of allowing a full output tank to stop production."]
	quest.E771260B5C787ACA.title: "Use Every Drop of Creosote"
	quest.E771260B5C787ACA.quest_desc: ["Treated wood is an early infrastructure material, not decoration only.", "Convert creosote into planned batches and keep a buffer for wiring, scaffolding and machines. Oversized uncontrolled tanks only postpone a blockage."]
	quest.C36CEA6924CE2E77.title: "Motor as a Standard Component"
	quest.C36CEA6924CE2E77.quest_desc: ["Modern Industrialization motors connect electrical industry to mechanical work.", "Treat motors as stocked components. Producing them one at a time will become a bottleneck as machine hulls and cross-mod parts begin consuming them."]
	quest.B4F20A0C67EF1200.title: "Power Networks Need Limits"
	quest.B4F20A0C67EF1200.quest_desc: ["Do not connect unfamiliar machines to the largest available network without checking their tier and demand.", "Separate generation, buffering and consumers. Label lines and leave capacity for startup spikes and later automation."]
	quest.984E0159892B0E76.title: "Automation Readiness Check"
	quest.984E0159892B0E76.quest_desc: ["Before advancing, verify that each branch can be repeated without manual emergency work.", "Provide buffered inputs, controlled outputs, overflow handling, maintenance access and a visible indication of stalled production."]
	quest.F8CB87B3063D8541.title: "Industrial Frame"
	quest.F8CB87B3063D8541.quest_desc: ["The industrial frame proves that the three foundations and the Create interface are functioning together.", "It gates strategic machines because it represents an integrated factory standard, not because it is merely expensive metal."]
	quest.515835E1E6E7125D.title: "Foundation Review"
	quest.515835E1E6E7125D.quest_desc: ["You should now be able to explain stress, speed, material analysis, motor production and creosote handling without relying on trial and error.", "Document your layouts and bottlenecks. The next stages will multiply throughput and make undocumented improvisation expensive."]
	quest.16838B1A7CA4BE89.title: "Industrial Frame — Repeatability Gate"
	quest.16838B1A7CA4BE89.quest_desc: ["The frame proves that structural parts, motors and kinetic automation operate as one production standard.","Acceptance: produce or provision a batch of four, automate normal inputs and outputs, and prevent full by-product storage from deadlocking the line.","Strategic machines use this frame because it represents integrated infrastructure, not merely expensive metal."]
	quest.33D42DC311D2F9BE.title: "Chemical Processor — Closed Material Flow"
	quest.33D42DC311D2F9BE.quest_desc: ["Connect controlled electronics to chemical processing and pressure-dependent infrastructure.","Acceptance: complete three consecutive cycles while every fluid, gas and solid by-product has a valid destination; buffer at least two cycles of critical inputs.","Any unhandled secondary output is treated as a production failure."]
	quest.3EE8E42D0138A34A.title: "Resonant Core — Energy Stability Gate"
	quest.3EE8E42D0138A34A.quest_desc: ["Unify Nitro Powah, high-tier Mekanism control and the entry requirements for Draconic Evolution.","Acceptance: stored energy covers two complete high-tier production cycles after generation stops, and the network survives simultaneous machine startup.","Peak demand, not average demand, determines whether this stage is stable."]
	quest.6B91727E7931BD65.title: "Transmutation Matrix — Controlled EMC"
	quest.6B91727E7931BD65.quest_desc: ["ProjectE is introduced as a governed conversion system, not permission to erase the progression graph.","Acceptance: seal-locked and non-EMC items stay outside automated conversion, import and export are separated, and excluded materials are documented.","Transmutation may remove repetition; it must not remove technological prerequisites."]
	quest.0D199D42E619C8CF.title: "Cosmic Catalyst — Final Integration Review"
	quest.0D199D42E619C8CF.quest_desc: ["The catalyst joins Avaritia-scale crafting with every preceding industrial standard.","Acceptance: the factory can reproduce all prerequisite components, critical patterns and control items from stored or renewable inputs after a controlled shutdown.","Keep independent backups of progression seals, digital patterns and recovery equipment before calling the endgame infrastructure complete."]
	quest.1837076B0EA3C11A.title: "Belts: Observable Logistics"
	quest.4C7CD3858A2BE870.title: "Mechanical Press: Continuous Output"
	quest.1D00D782B8F0B6D6.title: "Mechanical Mixer: Basin Discipline"
	quest.732D1A96512F2BFD.title: "Steam Engine: Capacity Before Speed"
	quest.19754AE8C11A6317.title: "Deployer: Controlled Interaction"
	quest.0EE2E9EB6DC01E34.title: "Precision Mechanism: Sequenced Assembly"
	quest.0EE2E9EB6DC01E34.quest_desc: ["Precision mechanisms are a repeatable manufacturing process, not a manual milestone tax.","Acceptance: automate every sequence step, loop incomplete items correctly, isolate junk output, and complete a batch of sixteen without manual reinsertion."]
	quest.61348E2551E8AD6C.title: "Rotation Speed Controller: Governed RPM"
	quest.197AB0E07A40512F.title: "Water Wheels: Stable Generation"
	quest.51CCB7ACFD7B45F1.title: "Brass Casing: Heated Production Gate"
	quest.51CCB7ACFD7B45F1.quest_desc: ["Brass infrastructure marks the transition from andesite machinery to controlled heated production.","Acceptance: blaze-burner fuel is managed safely, zinc and copper inputs are buffered, and a batch of sixteen casings can be repeated without moving the mixer."]
	quest.774B1D4152A0B4ED.title: "Engineer's Hammer — Multiblock Control"
	quest.174228D87BAF69B2.title: "Voltmeter — Measure Before Connecting"
	quest.174228D87BAF69B2.quest_desc: ["Voltage tier, transfer limits and stored energy must be checked before unfamiliar machines share a network.","Acceptance: measure source and buffer state, label the line tier, and preserve at least 25% normal transfer headroom before adding another consumer."]
	quest.47709C807D643108.title: "Preheaters — Throughput With Power Cost"
	quest.47709C807D643108.quest_desc: ["Preheaters accelerate the reinforced furnace but add continuous electrical demand and another failure point.","Acceptance: install the intended pair, measure demand under load, keep 25% network headroom, and verify that loss of power does not deadlock material routing."]
	quest.316399F0B5F729CA.title: "Engineer's Crafting Table — Dedicated Assembly"
	quest.39C8CD6102B26BFE.title: "Engineer's Workbench — Upgrade Discipline"
	quest.1AFBE29BB6CC2C0D.quest_desc: ["Mechanical components are repeated machine inputs and become a hidden bottleneck when crafted only at the final assembly step.","Acceptance: maintain labelled buffers for iron and steel components, target at least sixteen of each, and expose the slowest plate or rod process for scaling."]
	quest.7F00E38513D06DF9.title: "Fluid Pipes — Directed Material Flow"
	quest.7F00E38513D06DF9.quest_desc: ["A connected pipe network is not automatically a controlled network; unintended connections can mix products or drain buffers.","Acceptance: label source and destination, use deliberate extraction points, provide shutoff access, and verify that a full destination cannot block an unrelated process."]
	quest.63768F7BC7BD0188.title: "Fluid Pump — Bounded Transfer"
	quest.63768F7BC7BD0188.quest_desc: ["The pump defines active fluid movement and must be sized around buffer capacity rather than maximum theoretical speed.","Acceptance: power it through a protected line, prevent dry or wrong-fluid transfer, add a controllable stop condition, and test recovery after the destination fills."]
	quest.0884D6C10B1047A2.title: "Garden Cloche — Sustainable Input Contract"
	quest.0884D6C10B1047A2.quest_desc: ["The cloche is useful only when water, power, soil and output handling form a stable contract with downstream machines.","Acceptance: run three harvest cycles unattended, stop safely on full storage, keep seed recovery independent, and document the actual output rate used by consumers."]
	quest.439D48E9647FC8C2.title: "Bronze Boiler — Stable Steam Contract"
	quest.2F66F85A601AC908.title: "Bronze Macerator — Ore Intake Standard"
	quest.5676B5FD97FB10C3.title: "Bronze Furnace — Continuous Smelting"
	quest.6F63B60042A7F6AE.title: "Bronze Compressor — Plate Throughput"
	quest.4722157BC8D3B965.title: "Bronze Cutting Machine — Component Yield"
	quest.22420EF3089DD7F6.title: "Assembler — Recipe Isolation"
	quest.250D1E2BFE6E0D50.title: "Advanced Large Steam Boiler — Generation Redundancy"
	quest.11CED277F3A317D0.title: "Inscriber — Processor Production Cell"
	quest.11CED277F3A317D0.quest_desc: ["Processors are recurring infrastructure components; one shared unfiltered Inscriber becomes a permanent bottleneck and can trap the wrong press.","Acceptance: isolate press recipes, automate silicon and printed circuits, return reusable presses, and complete sixteen mixed processors without inventory correction."]
	quest.15F7524D7B3E023C.title: "Storage Bus — External Inventory Contract"
	quest.33DD68B85F163F50.title: "Import Bus — Bounded Extraction"
	quest.61C3E32E629F6E1E.title: "Export Bus — Controlled Stocking"
	quest.726DF1B2F0DFE008.title: "Quantum Ring — Cross-Dimensional Reliability"
	quest.162CE44400A63575.title: "Metallurgic Infuser — Infusion Accounting"
	quest.08DDE018A804BFE7.title: "Enrichment Chamber — Concentrate Buffer"
	quest.7AE502EDB73BD57A.title: "Crusher — Controlled Reduction"
	quest.6C25D42C36175BF4.title: "Purification Chamber — Threefold Ore Contract"
	quest.4AFF81D3D0E78255.title: "Chemical Washer — Slurry Purity"
	quest.3999760881C855FA.title: "Chemical Crystallizer — Crystal Throughput"
	quest.587A19FC348387C5.title: "Pressurized Reaction Chamber — Three-Domain Recipe Control"
	quest.7EA6B942D1294ED6.title: "Digital Miner — Bounded Extraction Project"
	chapter.BB8991485482A0AC.title: "Core Technology Manual I"
	quest.F81E0A028C5C063F.title: "Rotational Network Model"
	quest.F81E0A028C5C063F.quest_desc: ["Create transmits rotation through connected components. Speed, direction and stress capacity are separate properties and must be inspected together.","A working design starts with a labelled source, a measurable distribution path and an intentional shutdown point; adding shafts does not add capacity."]
	quest.AC275065482E87D8.title: "Sources and Stress Capacity"
	quest.AC275065482E87D8.quest_desc: ["Water wheels, steam engines and other sources provide stress capacity. Consumers spend that capacity according to their stress impact and current speed.","Keep normal operation below the absolute limit, reserve capacity for startup spikes and split independent factories instead of building one fragile universal shaft."]
	quest.377F3890FCF854C4.title: "Ratios, Speed and Direction"
	quest.377F3890FCF854C4.quest_desc: ["Cogwheel ratios and speed controllers change RPM, while gearboxes and chain drives route direction. Faster processing usually increases stress demand.","Choose speed from the slowest stable process, document every ratio change and avoid hidden direction reversals that only appear after a line is expanded."]
	quest.2372BBDD46B032BD.title: "Belts and Visible Throughput"
	quest.2372BBDD46B032BD.quest_desc: ["Belts make item flow observable, which is useful for finding spacing problems, blocked outputs and uneven processing times.","A belt line needs controlled insertion, extraction, overflow handling and enough spacing for the slowest machine; visual motion is not proof of sustained throughput."]
	quest.9F9E91C624EA6812.title: "Mechanical Processing Cells"
	quest.9F9E91C624EA6812.quest_desc: ["Presses, mixers, crushers, saws and deployers should be arranged as repeatable cells with defined inputs, outputs and recovery access.","Test each cell with a full batch, return reusable tools and containers, and stop upstream delivery before a full destination scatters or destroys workpieces."]
	quest.63A27BD30FD8480C.title: "Sequenced Assembly"
	quest.63A27BD30FD8480C.quest_desc: ["Sequenced assembly applies several operations to an incomplete item. Wrong order, missing tools or uncontrolled recirculation can consume materials without producing a result.","Use a bounded loop, verify every operation and chance, recover incomplete items and maintain enough component stock for one complete sequence rather than one individual step."]
	quest.F739F4192D5DBA5A.title: "Fluid Networks"
	quest.F739F4192D5DBA5A.quest_desc: ["Pumps define flow direction and tanks provide buffering. Pipe connectivity alone does not guarantee correct routing when several fluids or consumers share a network.","Separate incompatible fluids, label pump direction, reserve expansion capacity and ensure a full output tank stops production before the source is wasted."]
	quest.3003D7ABB2BE8504.title: "Filters and Stock Control"
	quest.3003D7ABB2BE8504.quest_desc: ["Funnels, tunnels, filters and threshold switches turn visible transport into controlled logistics. Broad filters are convenient but can route future items into the wrong machine.","Use explicit tags only when their membership is intended, cap maintained stock and test the line with an unexpected item before trusting unattended production."]
	quest.3CAECC260F5DE3A4.title: "Contraptions and Moving Inventories"
	quest.3CAECC260F5DE3A4.quest_desc: ["Contraptions move blocks, inventories and tools as one assembly. Movement changes which interfaces remain accessible and how items are transferred at stations.","Provide safe clearance, emergency disassembly, predictable loading and unloading, and a recovery plan for a stopped assembly outside its home position."]
	quest.95FC9E2BE1C4B2E2.title: "Rail Logistics"
	quest.95FC9E2BE1C4B2E2.quest_desc: ["Trains are long-distance logistics systems, not faster belts. Schedules, station ownership, chunk availability and transfer time determine reliability.","Separate passenger and freight intent, prevent two stations from competing for one cargo, include timeout behavior and keep critical recovery supplies on both sides of a route."]
	quest.6BFE5482D5852EEB.title: "Create Diagnostics"
	quest.6BFE5482D5852EEB.quest_desc: ["Goggles and network readouts reveal stress, speed and machine state. Diagnose from the first failed boundary instead of replacing random shafts or adding uncontrolled power.","Record source capacity, consumer load, RPM and blocked inventory state; reproduce the failure with a small batch before changing a working production network."]
	quest.1284C2FB7B9EF266.title: "Project: Repeatable Kinetic Factory"
	quest.1284C2FB7B9EF266.quest_desc: ["Build one factory that accepts buffered raw materials and produces at least three processed outputs through separate, measurable cells.","The project passes when it restarts after empty inputs, stops safely on full outputs, shows stress reserve, exposes bottlenecks and completes two consecutive batches without manual item movement."]
	quest.E3540A1715EF05F2.title: "Engineer's Manual and Multiblocks"
	quest.E3540A1715EF05F2.quest_desc: ["Immersive Engineering uses shaped multiblocks with specific orientation, formation points and input/output faces. The manual is part of the machine interface, not optional flavor text.","Before forming a structure, verify dimensions, clear maintenance space and label planned ports so later pipes and wires do not block access."]
	quest.A3D60C4D902B79F3.title: "Coke Oven and Creosote"
	quest.A3D60C4D902B79F3.quest_desc: ["The Coke Oven produces both solid coke products and creosote. Either full output can halt the same process.","Provide independent storage, convert creosote into planned treated-wood batches and preserve enough coke for steel production instead of consuming every output as fuel."]
	quest.2F8C0DB8894CEDD9.title: "Steel Production"
	quest.2F8C0DB8894CEDD9.quest_desc: ["Blast furnaces convert iron and coke into steel with slag as a secondary output. Preheaters improve throughput but add continuous power demand.","Balance coke supply, iron input, slag extraction and output storage; measure the complete batch time before deciding whether another furnace or preheater is justified."]
	quest.EA79999088AC5FCF.title: "Wire Tiers and Loss Boundaries"
	quest.EA79999088AC5FCF.quest_desc: ["Wire types differ in transfer limits and intended voltage tier. A connector, relay or machine can become the bottleneck even when the generator is large enough.","Document each tier transition, avoid accidental long-distance low-tier trunks and protect critical machines from sharing a line with irregular high-demand consumers."]
	quest.D40F384449CEBE79.title: "Connectors, Relays and Topology"
	quest.D40F384449CEBE79.quest_desc: ["Connectors terminate energy at machines; relays route wires without exposing an inventory or power port. Mixing their roles creates confusing networks.","Build a readable topology with junction labels, service isolation and no crossing wire that must be removed to reach another component."]
	quest.907BE71CA2FE869E.title: "Buffers and Demand Spikes"
	quest.907BE71CA2FE869E.quest_desc: ["Capacitors separate generation rate from short demand spikes and expose whether a network is slowly losing energy over time.","Size buffers from measured cycle demand, configure input/output sides deliberately and test recovery after simultaneous machine startup rather than relying on a full idle capacitor."]
	quest.161F748018929362.title: "Standard Components"
	quest.161F748018929362.quest_desc: ["Iron, steel and electronic components recur across tools and multiblocks. Producing them one at a time turns every later machine into a manual interruption.","Maintain minimum stock, record component demand by project and automate plates, rods and wires before expanding into machines that consume them continuously."]
	quest.8121A4F6C57E7BAA.title: "Pumps, Pipes and Tank Safety"
	quest.8121A4F6C57E7BAA.quest_desc: ["Fluid pipes share capacity and pumps define active movement. A visually connected line may still fail because a side, redstone mode or destination is incorrect.","Label fluids, separate incompatible networks, expose tank levels and stop producers before a full destination forces a valuable byproduct to block the plant."]
	quest.ECEB8E8F97095296.title: "Fuel Processing and Diesel Generation"
	quest.ECEB8E8F97095296.quest_desc: ["Diesel generation depends on an entire chain of crops or oil products, refining, fluid buffers and generator demand; the generator alone is not the system.","Calculate net energy after farm and processing costs, reserve startup fuel and prevent a power failure from disabling the pumps needed to restore fuel production."]
	quest.FACAB8446DC28354.title: "Excavator Project Planning"
	quest.FACAB8446DC28354.quest_desc: ["The Excavator is a large regional extraction project with high continuous energy demand and deposit-dependent output.","Survey before construction, provide bulk transport and overflow, compare deposit value with operating cost and ensure the machine cannot become an early source of progression-locked materials."]
	quest.73F71F969BFB6012.title: "Industrial Diagnostics"
	quest.73F71F969BFB6012.quest_desc: ["The voltmeter and visible machine state should be used to locate the first failing boundary: generation, wire capacity, machine input, fluid supply or blocked output.","Record measurements before changing the network, isolate one section at a time and preserve a known-good baseline so an attempted repair does not create a second fault."]
	quest.2A2E995964922438.title: "Project: Integrated Industrial Yard"
	quest.2A2E995964922438.quest_desc: ["Construct a serviceable yard that produces coke, creosote products and steel while feeding one powered IE machine through a documented wire network.","The project passes when all byproducts are handled, buffers expose shortages, maintenance access remains open and two complete steel batches finish without manual transfers."]
	quest.128615634CED098E.title: "Steam as a Production Utility"
	quest.128615634CED098E.quest_desc: ["Early MI machines are a shared steam system. Boiler fuel, water delivery, steam storage and pipe throughput determine whether individual machines can sustain work.","Keep dry-boiler protection, reserve water, separate generation from consumers and measure steam recovery between batches."]
	quest.77F66B7318E67C88.title: "Bronze Machine Workshop"
	quest.77F66B7318E67C88.quest_desc: ["Bronze machines establish crushing, smelting, cutting and compression before electrical tiers. Their low speed is intended to teach flow design, not permanent manual feeding.","Build common input and output buffers, preserve byproducts and queue enough work to observe the actual slowest machine."]
	quest.1828C74ACF99DFCC.title: "Item and Fluid Pipe Contracts"
	quest.1828C74ACF99DFCC.quest_desc: ["MI pipes use connections, extraction settings and filters to define movement. A pipe touching a machine is not automatically a valid route.","Document extraction points, avoid circular routes, reserve maintenance sides and test the network with a blocked destination and an unexpected item."]
	quest.58C4FB28BD20CDFD.title: "Electric Tier Transition"
	quest.58C4FB28BD20CDFD.quest_desc: ["Electric hulls replace steam consumption with voltage-tiered energy and recurring circuits, motors and cables.","Move only after component stock and generation can support several machines; one powered hull without a component supply chain is not an industrial transition."]
	quest.B60421514100B713.title: "Voltage and Transformer Boundaries"
	quest.B60421514100B713.quest_desc: ["Machine tiers accept specific voltage classes. Transformers connect tiers but do not make an undersized cable or generator safe.","Label every boundary, isolate new machines during commissioning and verify both normal draw and startup behavior before joining a production bus."]
	quest.4B2A2D1812769D31.title: "Overclocking and Energy Cost"
	quest.4B2A2D1812769D31.quest_desc: ["Overclocking improves throughput by increasing machine energy demand and may shift the bottleneck into generation, input transport or output handling.","Add upgrades only after measuring a complete line, preserve thermal and power margin and compare parallel machines with one heavily upgraded machine."]
	quest.5F37BD6605608008.title: "Circuit Production"
	quest.5F37BD6605608008.quest_desc: ["Circuits are tier gates assembled from plates, wires, components and increasingly complex intermediate parts.","Stock recurring subcomponents, separate circuit tiers, record per-machine demand and avoid consuming the last lower-tier circuit needed to rebuild its own production line."]
	quest.9E1FBD2BFA04CCC7.title: "Industrial Multiblocks"
	quest.9E1FBD2BFA04CCC7.quest_desc: ["Large MI structures trade construction and infrastructure cost for sustained throughput. Hatch placement and tier compatibility define the actual machine.","Plan ports before building, leave service corridors, match energy and fluid hatches and verify minimum and expanded forms separately."]
	quest.D9133AB289D9525B.title: "Byproducts and Closed Loops"
	quest.D9133AB289D9525B.quest_desc: ["Chemical and refining recipes often return secondary fluids or materials that are required elsewhere. Voiding them can make a later chain unnecessarily expensive.","Map every output, recycle only when the loop has a controlled purge and ensure a full low-value byproduct cannot stop a high-value process."]
	quest.139FD0860123D9CB.title: "Assembler and Repeated Components"
	quest.139FD0860123D9CB.quest_desc: ["The Assembler converts component stocking into repeatable machine production. It becomes useful only when inputs arrive in stable ratios and outputs leave automatically.","Run several recipes, isolate incompatible fluids, keep templates documented and verify the line can rebuild one of its own upstream components."]
	quest.55E7C76F7F9D2062.title: "MI Diagnostics and Maintenance"
	quest.55E7C76F7F9D2062.quest_desc: ["A stopped MI line should be diagnosed by energy tier, pipe extraction, recipe inputs, machine progress and output capacity in that order.","Preserve wrench access, label side configuration, use test batches and compare expected material balance with actual inventories before replacing machines."]
	quest.3245C8766BC1F7FB.title: "Project: Steam-to-Electric Factory"
	quest.3245C8766BC1F7FB.quest_desc: ["Build a factory that turns raw ore into processed material, manufactures recurring components and assembles one electric machine without hand-moving intermediate items.","The project passes after two repeated builds, safe recovery from a full output, documented voltage boundaries and a stored reserve of every component required to restart production."]
	quest.9CE30FB7CD26B1A5.title: "Certus, Fluix and Crystal Supply"
	quest.9CE30FB7CD26B1A5.quest_desc: ["AE2 depends on recurring certus, charged certus and fluix products. Treat them as production materials rather than one-time quest items.","Automate charging and fluix preparation, separate crystal states and keep enough reserve to rebuild power, terminals and processor production after a network failure."]
	quest.EEC3A17819603C73.title: "Network Power and Idle Cost"
	quest.EEC3A17819603C73.quest_desc: ["Every active device contributes to AE network demand. A system can fail during autocrafting even when idle power appears stable.","Use external buffering, observe idle and peak draw, isolate nonessential devices and ensure power loss does not trap the only tools needed to repair the network."]
	quest.37A2614776AA14DD.title: "Channels and Dense Trunks"
	quest.37A2614776AA14DD.quest_desc: ["Channels are a topology constraint. Smart cables expose usage, dense cables aggregate branches and ad-hoc expansion can silently exceed a path limit.","Budget channels before placement, label trunks, reserve expansion and design failure boundaries so one cut does not remove storage, crafting and monitoring together."]
	quest.F3F6685DE19B24CF.title: "Cells, Bytes and Types"
	quest.F3F6685DE19B24CF.quest_desc: ["Storage cells have both byte capacity and type limits. Many tiny stacks can fill types while leaving most bytes unused.","Separate bulk materials from diverse equipment, partition specialized cells, expose remaining capacity and provide an overflow route that cannot loop back into the same full storage."]
	quest.B2D73A57683EFF07.title: "External Storage and Priority"
	quest.B2D73A57683EFF07.quest_desc: ["Storage buses expose external inventories to the network. Priorities decide insertion and extraction order, while duplicate exposure can create recursive behavior.","Connect an inventory once, document priority, reserve machine output space and test extraction after both preferred and fallback stores contain the same item."]
	quest.C39AB18EF836F065.title: "Subnets and Functional Boundaries"
	quest.C39AB18EF836F065.quest_desc: ["Subnets isolate channels and functions while quartz fiber can share power without joining channel logic.","Create dedicated import, storage or machine-control subnets, document their boundary and verify the main network remains usable when one subnet is disconnected."]
	quest.DDB2DB4EDE9314BF.title: "Processor Manufacturing"
	quest.DDB2DB4EDE9314BF.quest_desc: ["Logic, calculation and engineering processors are recurring parts. Manual press swapping creates mistakes and blocks all advanced infrastructure.","Dedicate or positively route presses, automate silicon and printed parts, return reusable tools and keep a minimum stock for emergency network reconstruction."]
	quest.286A05049884FAFB.title: "Processing and Crafting Patterns"
	quest.286A05049884FAFB.quest_desc: ["Crafting patterns describe grid recipes; processing patterns describe an external transformation. Using the wrong type hides outputs or creates loops.","Name providers by destination, encode every secondary output, prevent recipes that request their own output and test one pattern with unavailable input before enabling bulk requests."]
	quest.2AEBBD355CA6385C.title: "Crafting CPU Capacity"
	quest.2AEBBD355CA6385C.quest_desc: ["Crafting storage limits the size of an active job and co-processors allow more parallel processing steps; neither fixes a missing ingredient or blocked machine.","Size CPUs from measured jobs, separate critical and bulk requests, expose stuck tasks and keep one small CPU free for recovery components during a large craft."]
	quest.F958010A69C13B3B.title: "P2P Tunnels"
	quest.F958010A69C13B3B.quest_desc: ["P2P tunnels transport channels or other resources through an AE path. They compress topology but make undocumented networks difficult to repair.","Label input/output pairs, avoid hidden nested dependencies, reserve tunnel capacity and verify endpoint loss fails only the intended subsystem."]
	quest.DD9F85F98340A961.title: "Quantum Network Link"
	quest.DD9F85F98340A961.quest_desc: ["Quantum bridges connect distant networks with substantial ongoing energy demand and two critical endpoints.","Power both sides independently, keep recovery items outside the bridge, test reconnection and ensure unloaded or failed remote infrastructure cannot stall unrelated local autocrafting."]
	quest.4CEF06B4C6DB4531.title: "Project: Resilient Autocrafting Network"
	quest.4CEF06B4C6DB4531.quest_desc: ["Build a channel-documented network with bulk and diverse storage, one functional subnet, automated processors and at least five external processing patterns.","The project passes when two simultaneous jobs finish, one subnet can be disconnected safely, a blocked machine is diagnosable and recovery parts remain available during a large request."]
	quest.73DC027ACFC62E99.title: "Circuits, Alloys and Machine Tiers"
	quest.73DC027ACFC62E99.quest_desc: ["Mekanism tiers consume recurring control circuits and infused alloys. Building only the final machine hides a component bottleneck.","Automate infusion inputs, stock every lower tier and reserve enough components to rebuild the machine that produces the next tier."]
	quest.2B4F57928E155CB6.title: "Upgrades, Factories and Energy"
	quest.2B4F57928E155CB6.quest_desc: ["Speed and factory upgrades increase parallel throughput and energy demand. Energy upgrades reduce cost but do not solve input or output saturation.","Upgrade after measuring the complete line, size cables and buffers for peak draw and compare one factory with several independently serviceable machines."]
	quest.0A9BD05294480AA8.title: "Transporters and Side Configuration"
	quest.0A9BD05294480AA8.quest_desc: ["Items, fluids, gases and energy use different transport systems with pull/push rules, color channels and machine side configuration.","Label each medium, avoid unrestricted round trips, preserve maintenance sides and test the network with a full destination and a disabled consumer."]
	quest.D99E0BAB00514D28.title: "Gas Production and Dumping"
	quest.D99E0BAB00514D28.quest_desc: ["Many chemical machines stop when either gas input is empty or an unwanted coproduct tank is full. Dumping is an operating policy, not a default fix.","Buffer every gas, document dump modes, preserve emergency oxygen or hydrogen and stop upstream production when a valuable gas destination is full."]
	quest.4640F27407479271.title: "Twofold Ore Processing"
	quest.4640F27407479271.quest_desc: ["Enrichment and smelting provide a compact twofold route suitable for moderate throughput and early automation.","Measure raw input, enriched output and final ingots over one stack; use the result as a baseline before accepting the infrastructure cost of chemical multiplication."]
	quest.E32B5AD59381565F.title: "Threefold Ore Processing"
	quest.E32B5AD59381565F.quest_desc: ["Purification adds oxygen and clumps before crushing and enrichment. The yield matters only if the gas and downstream machines keep pace.","Buffer oxygen and clumps, stop raw input on saturation and record the slowest stage across a complete raw-ore batch."]
	quest.3D75E5354AC552C3.title: "Fourfold Ore Processing"
	quest.3D75E5354AC552C3.quest_desc: ["Chemical injection adds hydrogen chloride and shards. Acid precursor production, gas capacity and intermediate storage become part of the ore cost.","Calculate net resource and energy demand, isolate shards by material and ensure acid failure stops ore delivery before partial intermediates accumulate."]
	quest.0FDF4DBDA9DE4707.title: "Fivefold Slurry Processing"
	quest.0FDF4DBDA9DE4707.quest_desc: ["Dissolution, washing and crystallization form a sulfuric-acid and slurry chain with multiple hazardous buffers.","Separate dirty and clean slurry, prohibit silent chemical dumping, interlock acid input with washer and crystallizer capacity and validate the whole route with a bounded batch."]
	quest.44B94BA5A7DA15F0.title: "Fission, Coolant and Waste"
	quest.44B94BA5A7DA15F0.quest_desc: ["Fission output is limited by coolant delivery, heat removal and radioactive waste handling. Raising burn rate before those systems are proven creates a delayed failure.","Start at low burn, measure steady temperatures, buffer coolant and waste, provide shutdown logic and keep recovery equipment outside the radiation area."]
	quest.5BCD580F0880D9B2.title: "Fusion Fuel Infrastructure"
	quest.5BCD580F0880D9B2.quest_desc: ["Fusion requires sustained deuterium, tritium and supporting thermal systems. A successful ignition does not prove continuous operation.","Maintain independent fuel reserves, measure production against injection rate, plan restart energy and ensure one upstream slowdown cannot empty both fuels simultaneously."]
	quest.9670FDBDCD3FCA23.title: "SPS and Antimatter"
	quest.9670FDBDCD3FCA23.quest_desc: ["The SPS converts polonium using an enormous energy budget. Antimatter is therefore a factory-capacity proof, not a passive timer.","Provide isolated energy storage, stable polonium supply, visible progress and a shutdown threshold that protects the wider grid from complete discharge."]
	quest.A9339FE080F201E9.title: "Project: Interlocked Chemical Complex"
	quest.A9339FE080F201E9.quest_desc: ["Build a complex that sustains gases, runs at least a threefold ore chain and supports one hazardous late chemical process with automatic shutdown conditions.","The project passes after two bounded batches, no silent dumping, visible buffer levels, documented energy draw and recovery from a deliberately blocked downstream machine."]
	chapter.B0DE2289887F82FC.title: "Core Technology Manual III"
	quest.479BF3287FB111DB.title: "Draconium Supply and Stage Entry"
	quest.479BF3287FB111DB.quest_desc: ["Draconium begins a high-energy material branch whose mining, processing and storage must already be repeatable before advanced cores are attempted.","Separate raw supply from component stock, preserve emergency ingots and prevent dimension or resource simulators from granting awakened materials early."]
	quest.B9C2B47543053BB5.title: "Energy Core Structure and Measurement"
	quest.B9C2B47543053BB5.quest_desc: ["Draconic energy cores trade large construction cost for extreme capacity. Capacity is useful only when input and output transfer can reach it safely.","Document core tier and stabilizers, measure charge and discharge, reserve black-start energy and isolate the core from uncontrolled wireless drains."]
	quest.6C6AC84D59D102A1.title: "Fusion Crafting Architecture"
	quest.6C6AC84D59D102A1.quest_desc: ["Fusion crafting combines a central ingredient, injector inventory and a large energy transfer. Missing one injector or item can hold an expensive setup indefinitely.","Label injector positions, automate exact quantities, recover unused ingredients and prove the grid can stop before draining the protected factory reserve."]
	quest.AFA6DA8ACA987DE7.title: "Injector Tiers and Symmetry"
	quest.AFA6DA8ACA987DE7.quest_desc: ["Injector tiers limit recipes and energy delivery. Mixing tiers or ambiguous placement creates a setup that looks complete but cannot start.","Upgrade injectors as a matched set, preserve access for automation and verify the lowest injector tier before diagnosing power or ingredient failure."]
	quest.A9447747F2B69513.title: "Wyvern as the First Capability Gate"
	quest.A9447747F2B69513.quest_desc: ["Wyvern cores unlock equipment, energy and crafting capabilities beyond ordinary industrial tiers. Their recipe must prove resonant energy and dimensional preparation.","Keep the core at zero EMC, remove alternate recipes and require the resonant core plus the dimensional resonator before mass production."]
	quest.99242D6529BA8135.title: "Awakened Material Production"
	quest.99242D6529BA8135.quest_desc: ["Awakened Draconium is a dedicated fusion-crafting era, not a simple upgrade of raw Draconium. It combines rare inputs, injector tier and substantial energy.","Gate the first awakened core behind the draconic processor, automate only after one audited craft and block loot, EMC, seeds and simulation routes."]
	quest.723EE68292454C66.title: "Modular Equipment and Power Budget"
	quest.723EE68292454C66.quest_desc: ["Draconic equipment capability depends on installed modules, configuration and available energy. Maximum modules can create a larger grid demand than expected.","Separate combat and utility profiles, protect recovery charge, document module effects and verify equipment cannot bypass a later travel or mining permission."]
	quest.1CDE684412C1CFC5.title: "Draconic Reactor Containment"
	quest.1CDE684412C1CFC5.quest_desc: ["The reactor is an energy project with explicit containment, fuel conversion and catastrophic failure states. High output is not permission to ignore shutdown engineering.","Commission at low load, separate containment power, automate shutdown thresholds and keep all recovery equipment outside the potential failure area."]
	quest.18792AEE22A3FABF.title: "Chaos Resources and Expedition Control"
	quest.18792AEE22A3FABF.quest_desc: ["Chaos resources are tied to dangerous remote encounters and should remain proof of combat and logistics readiness, not a simulated renewable commodity.","Prepare independent return equipment, secure drops immediately, prohibit ordinary farming paths and reserve shards for declared endgame projects."]
	quest.C6C5FCAF48F8D81F.title: "Project: Audited Draconic Infrastructure"
	quest.C6C5FCAF48F8D81F.quest_desc: ["Build a measured energy core, a recoverable fusion-crafting grid and one modular equipment profile without using EMC, loot or simulated gated materials.","The project passes after one Wyvern and one Awakened production cycle, protected reserve verification, injector-tier audit and safe shutdown of every high-energy subsystem."]
	quest.C7D2332EBEF88656.title: "Crafting Table Tiers"
	quest.C7D2332EBEF88656.quest_desc: ["Extended Crafting tables increase grid size and therefore the number of distinct systems a recipe can require. Grid size alone is not meaningful difficulty.","Use higher tables only when a recipe expresses multiple completed production domains, and gate each table behind the stage that can supply those domains repeatedly."]
	quest.2AE1ED45F19ECF91.title: "Components and Catalysts"
	quest.2AE1ED45F19ECF91.quest_desc: ["Components and catalysts are recurring crafting standards across table tiers. Requiring huge counts without automation creates repetition rather than expertise.","Automate component families, preserve catalysts when the design treats them as tools and scale demand from demonstrated throughput instead of arbitrary stacks."]
	quest.2BAD2442338E85A6.title: "Combination Crafting Structure"
	quest.2BAD2442338E85A6.quest_desc: ["Combination crafting links a central core, pedestals, ingredients and energy. A visually complete ring can still fail through tier, range or missing power.","Label pedestal groups, supply exact quantities, expose energy progress and recover unused ingredients when a recipe is cancelled or rejected."]
	quest.418FBAE385684CA2.title: "Automating Large Recipes"
	quest.418FBAE385684CA2.quest_desc: ["Large grids are practical only when subcomponents, ingredient delivery and output extraction are repeatable. Manual placement should be a first-craft validation, not permanent gameplay.","Store recipes as documented bills of materials, preassemble modules, prevent partial starts and verify the system can repeat a craft after all buffers are emptied."]
	quest.B111D837DE0BB3C4.title: "Compression and Singularities"
	quest.B111D837DE0BB3C4.quest_desc: ["Compressors turn sustained material throughput into singularities. The challenge should be production capacity and logistics, not standing at a crafting table.","Choose fair amounts from automated rates, blacklist progression permissions, handle overflow and document the source factory for every singularity family."]
	quest.1E3125236A6971C5.title: "Fair Ingredient Selection"
	quest.1E3125236A6971C5.quest_desc: ["A fair expert recipe asks for representative outputs from completed systems, not rare decorative items, hidden loot or thousands of trivial materials.","Prefer reusable standards, automated intermediates, meaningful energy and bounded boss permissions; reject ingredients that add only search time or manual repetition."]
	quest.2D02F8A4C3F8E66E.title: "Cross-Mod Convergence"
	quest.2D02F8A4C3F8E66E.quest_desc: ["Extended Crafting is the natural place to combine chemistry, energy, logistics, dimensions and material engineering into one late-stage proof.","Every domain should contribute a completed component, and the dependency graph must prove that none of those components requires the recipe output itself."]
	quest.8280D2262682293A.title: "Recipe Review and Missing Paths"
	quest.8280D2262682293A.quest_desc: ["A recipe is not complete until JEI visibility, item IDs, table tier, catalyst behavior and every alternative acquisition path have been reviewed.","Use deterministic IDs, remove previous outputs only after replacement ingredients exist and keep a report of skipped definitions instead of silently deleting content."]
	quest.E6102D4EF2FA0104.title: "Creative Boundary Components"
	quest.E6102D4EF2FA0104.quest_desc: ["Ultimate components and singularities should lead toward creative convergence without granting creative capability on their own.","Keep them at zero EMC, block simulation and rewards, require completed stage standards and separate reusable permissions from consumed production materials."]
	quest.8C2C341C15C3C770.title: "Project: Automated Convergence Workshop"
	quest.8C2C341C15C3C770.quest_desc: ["Build a workshop that produces one large-grid component and one combination-crafting component from automated subassemblies across at least four mods.","The project passes after two repeated crafts, zero manual subcomponent production, no cyclic dependency, protected reusable catalysts and complete bypass review."]
	quest.F61910AD0881F718.title: "Compressed Crafting Foundations"
	quest.F61910AD0881F718.quest_desc: ["Compressed crafting tables represent accumulated manufacturing infrastructure. Their cost should be automated wood and crafting capacity, not prolonged manual clicking.","Automate table production, verify conversion ratios and keep the chain visible so a large count does not hide an accidental recursive recipe."]
	quest.BB378BF6A667FB35.title: "Neutron Collection as Time Infrastructure"
	quest.BB378BF6A667FB35.quest_desc: ["Neutron collectors convert installed machine count and elapsed time into a late material. Waiting alone should not be the only challenge.","Set a bounded collector target, provide automated extraction and storage, measure output per hour and avoid requiring an array so large that it only creates chunk load."]
	quest.D390C330C4165D08.title: "Neutronium Production Stock"
	quest.D390C330C4165D08.quest_desc: ["Neutronium is a recurring late material for catalysts, tools and structures. Crafting each ingot only when requested turns time into a hidden queue.","Maintain a minimum stock, expose collector throughput and reserve enough material to rebuild the extraction and crafting infrastructure itself."]
	quest.0FEC04E54FCD0EB8.title: "Crystal Matrix Integration"
	quest.0FEC04E54FCD0EB8.quest_desc: ["Crystal Matrix Ingots should combine extreme material purity with prior digital and draconic manufacturing, not appear from a standalone decorative recipe.","Require automated diamond or crystal supply, cross-mod standards and zero EMC while keeping the repeated recipe accessible to late factories."]
	quest.68AF48CB4560C817.title: "Singularities as Throughput Proof"
	quest.68AF48CB4560C817.quest_desc: ["A singularity should prove sustained production of a material family. Excessive counts punish storage and waiting rather than engineering.","Choose amounts from measured automated rates, include only renewable or deliberately stockpiled resources and block boss permissions or unique artifacts from compression."]
	quest.67D1FE65195257C9.title: "Infinity Catalyst Bill of Materials"
	quest.67D1FE65195257C9.quest_desc: ["The Infinity Catalyst is a convergence bill of materials. Every ingredient should represent a mastered system and have a repeatable source.","Audit the full dependency graph, replace hidden loot ingredients, prevent EMC or simulation and preassemble domain modules before the final craft."]
	quest.2432B86019D51476.title: "Infinity Ingot Convergence"
	quest.2432B86019D51476.quest_desc: ["The first Infinity Ingot should require cosmic assembly, antimatter, awakened infrastructure and the final dimensional permission without demanding pointless manual quantities.","Keep the recipe authoritative, remove reward and EMC paths and verify every reusable standard returns while consumed materials remain meaningful."]
	quest.FC626958FE6D77FD.title: "Extreme Crafting Table Boundary"
	quest.FC626958FE6D77FD.quest_desc: ["The Extreme Crafting Table is access to the final recipe space. If obtained early, every later ingredient gate becomes vulnerable.","Require the cosmic assembly and transmutation standards, set EMC to zero and audit all alternate table recipes, loot and quest rewards."]
	quest.93EF722F82AA7E37.title: "Creative Outputs and Final Permissions"
	quest.93EF722F82AA7E37.quest_desc: ["Creative items remove ordinary constraints and therefore require proof that the pack's major production domains have been completed, not merely one expensive material.","Route every creative recipe through the convergence matrix, prohibit duplication systems and require a visible checklist of energy, logistics, chemistry, dimensions and materials."]
	quest.9BEFD1A2696B39D9.title: "Project: Fair Infinity Production Cell"
	quest.9BEFD1A2696B39D9.quest_desc: ["Build a production cell that prepares neutronium, matrix ingots, required singularities and cross-mod modules for one Infinity Ingot without gated rewards or EMC.","The project passes after a complete material audit, zero dependency cycles, automated subcomponents, bounded collector count and a second reproducible ingot plan."]
	quest.142AC60559E5167F.title: "Dimension Preparation as Infrastructure"
	quest.142AC60559E5167F.quest_desc: ["DivineRPG progression is a chain of hostile dimensions, resources and bosses. Entering with only combat gear ignores return logistics, storage and replacement equipment.","Prepare a labelled portal room, independent return method, food and repair reserves, empty trophy storage and a written objective before every new dimension."]
	quest.C62FAADD011B0287.title: "Portal Order and Technology Gates"
	quest.C62FAADD011B0287.quest_desc: ["Dimension order should correspond to increasing equipment, resource processing and factory capability rather than portals built from any convenient side recipe.","Require the previous permission, block alternate portal-frame acquisition and explain which technology jump each dimension authorizes."]
	quest.4C8E7D0C3B1F7CCE.title: "Dimension Gear and Replacement Stock"
	quest.4C8E7D0C3B1F7CCE.quest_desc: ["DivineRPG equipment often answers specific damage, durability or movement requirements. The highest nominal armor is not always the safest expedition set.","Compare protection and repair materials, carry a replacement tool and keep one complete recovery set outside the target dimension."]
	quest.B099960D2668D990.title: "Dimension Resource Logistics"
	quest.B099960D2668D990.quest_desc: ["Dimension materials become ingredients in cross-mod technology. Manual backpack trips should validate a source once, not remain the permanent supply chain.","Create sorted return storage, process resources at a safe hub, track consumption by stage and prohibit resource simulators until the dimension permission is earned."]
	quest.3CD6D056FF139977.title: "Boss Readiness and Failure Recovery"
	quest.3CD6D056FF139977.quest_desc: ["A boss attempt should test equipment, arena control, healing and knowledge, not force repeated farming because the only recovery path was carried into the fight.","Build a safe approach, store a replacement kit, set a retreat condition and document the boss reward before consuming or storing it."]
	quest.708B74A7BB0C4AC0.title: "Reusable Boss Seals"
	quest.708B74A7BB0C4AC0.quest_desc: ["A boss victory grants a reusable permission seal. The seal proves progression without making every machine recipe consume another unique trophy.","Issue each seal once through its quest, make it unstackable and reusable, set EMC to zero and block loot, trade, seed and simulation copies."]
	quest.2CC29BBDF7CBAF13.title: "Seal-to-Technology Mapping"
	quest.2CC29BBDF7CBAF13.quest_desc: ["Each seal belongs at the first technology stage that uses its dimension's materials or proves equivalent combat readiness.","Keep Divine at precision manufacturing, Eden at chemistry, Wildwood at scale, Apalachia at resource control, Skythern at logistics, Mortum at resonant energy, Vethea at draconic, Wreck at transmutation and Luna at extreme fabrication."]
	quest.2103F62CC4CBD3BC.title: "Trophy Storage and Non-Consumable Evidence"
	quest.2103F62CC4CBD3BC.quest_desc: ["Boss drops can be unique, decorative or useful in original mod recipes. Using them as mass-consumed gates creates unfair repetition and migration risk.","Store original trophies separately, use seals for repeated technology recipes and keep a record of which quest issued each permission."]
	quest.8DB02A04F3A91B45.title: "Return Paths and Expedition Continuity"
	quest.8DB02A04F3A91B45.quest_desc: ["Dimension progression becomes frustrating when portal loss, death or unloaded infrastructure removes the only route home.","Maintain two independent return methods where possible, label coordinates, protect portal chunks and test the route before carrying irreplaceable materials."]
	quest.5E812AA87CA5B32F.title: "Project: Audited Dimension Progression"
	quest.5E812AA87CA5B32F.quest_desc: ["Complete a documented sequence of DivineRPG permissions with safe portals, recovery equipment, sorted resource storage and one cross-mod recipe unlocked by each major seal tier.","The project passes when no unique trophy is mass-consumed, every seal has one source, all simulated resources respect stage order and the final return route works after a restart."]
	quest.1D2ED2FC72642FBC.title: "Black Quartz and Early Analysis"
	quest.1D2ED2FC72642FBC.quest_desc: ["Black Quartz is an early analytical and electrical material used by several Actually Additions systems and the pack's common power-regulation branch.","Maintain a measured supply, avoid consuming the entire stock on decoration and preserve enough material for reconstruction, circuits and first power components."]
	quest.638914E0221792F7.title: "Atomic Reconstructor and Lens Control"
	quest.638914E0221792F7.quest_desc: ["The Atomic Reconstructor transforms blocks and items using energy and optional lenses. An unrestricted beam can convert the wrong inventory or surrounding blocks.","Enclose the beam, control activation, isolate input batches, document lens purpose and verify the output is removed before the next pulse."]
	quest.3429259E317D2C48.title: "Empowerer Symmetry and Energy"
	quest.3429259E317D2C48.quest_desc: ["The Empowerer combines a central item, four display stands and energy. Correct ingredients still fail when geometry, power or extraction is inconsistent.","Label stand positions, provide independent buffering, insert exact quantities and recover unused materials after a cancelled or incompatible recipe."]
	quest.6C55F22F359BFAB3.title: "Energizer, Enervator and Power Boundaries"
	quest.6C55F22F359BFAB3.quest_desc: ["Charging and discharging devices move energy between items and the factory. Portable cells can silently drain protected reserves or feed unintended machines.","Separate charging and recovery buses, set minimum reserves, filter allowed items and verify a full portable battery cannot bypass a later energy-storage stage."]
	quest.13382A540FB0D439.title: "Laser Relays and Network Ownership"
	quest.13382A540FB0D439.quest_desc: ["Laser relays move energy, items or fluids through wireless links. Dense relay webs become difficult to audit and can connect stages unintentionally.","Label networks, separate resource types and voltage intent, reserve link capacity and verify removing one relay cannot disable unrelated production."]
	quest.CCADB156B096AE0A.title: "Crushing and Secondary Outputs"
	quest.CCADB156B096AE0A.quest_desc: ["Actually Additions crushers can provide secondary outputs whose value changes the real ore-processing efficiency.","Measure both outputs, route them separately, stop input on either full destination and compare the line with Mekanism or MI before declaring one route obsolete."]
	quest.8CFDD48E6784B247.title: "Canola Oil and Fuel Upgrades"
	quest.8CFDD48E6784B247.quest_desc: ["Canola fuel is a multi-step renewable chain whose later fluids improve energy density at the cost of more machines and control.","Automate farming, fluid conversion and buffering, calculate net energy after processing and keep enough startup fuel to recover from an empty grid."]
	quest.B4A1E129A0612230.title: "Farmer Areas and Replanting"
	quest.B4A1E129A0612230.quest_desc: ["The Farmer combines harvesting and replanting over a fixed area. Seed shortage, full output or unsupported crops can stop only part of the field and hide the failure.","Reserve seed stock, separate products, expose blocked slots and verify two full crop cycles without dropped item accumulation."]
	quest.401ECC34627E56C6.title: "Crates, Filters and Overflow"
	quest.401ECC34627E56C6.quest_desc: ["Large crates are convenient bulk buffers but can hide an uncontrolled production surplus until extraction or item types become the true limit.","Assign crate purpose, use explicit filters, expose fill level and stop the producer before overflow is converted into dropped items or deletion."]
	quest.3DB07F4670E6EC4C.title: "Project: Regulated Utility Workshop"
	quest.3DB07F4670E6EC4C.quest_desc: ["Build an Actually Additions workshop with protected reconstruction, one Empowerer recipe, controlled laser relays and a renewable Canola or farming line.","The project passes after two repeated batches, safe beam containment, measured energy balance, recovery reserves and no wireless link crossing a later stage boundary."]
	chapter.1EDB8032AAA0ABE6.title: "Core Technology Manual IV"
	quest.DF63BBF6168A3F8C.title: "Alloy Smelting and Furnace Modes"
	quest.DF63BBF6168A3F8C.quest_desc: ["The Alloy Smelter shares ordinary smelting and multi-input alloy recipes. An unrestricted input can consume materials in the wrong mode or ratio.","Separate furnace and alloy schedules, insert exact batches, expose remaining ingredients and stop intake before an incomplete alloy occupies the machine."]
	quest.953C8C49CA5207FC.title: "Grinding Balls and Secondary Yield"
	quest.953C8C49CA5207FC.quest_desc: ["The SAG Mill changes speed and output chances through grinding balls. Nominal ore yield depends on both ball material and downstream handling.","Record ball consumption, separate primary and secondary products, compare net yield with other mods and prevent a full byproduct output from blocking valuable processing."]
	quest.6F2179E12429DDC4.title: "Conduits and Shared Block Space"
	quest.6F2179E12429DDC4.quest_desc: ["Ender IO conduits carry several resource types in one block space. Compact routing reduces visibility and makes accidental feedback paths easier to create.","Label channels, configure extraction explicitly, avoid uncontrolled round trips and preserve access to each connection for maintenance and diagnostics."]
	quest.12CB22DF3F74045E.title: "Filters, Priorities and Stocking"
	quest.12CB22DF3F74045E.quest_desc: ["Conduit filters define which items can enter or leave a connection. Broad filters and equal priorities can make several destinations compete unpredictably.","Use explicit whitelist intent, document priority, cap maintained stock and test an unexpected item plus a full preferred destination."]
	quest.7A94114F44DD4AD4.title: "Machine Capacitors and Operating Profiles"
	quest.7A94114F44DD4AD4.quest_desc: ["Capacitors change machine speed, energy storage and demand. A faster machine may overload conduits or starve adjacent processes.","Benchmark the complete line before upgrading, record peak draw and preserve a lower-power profile for recovery or low-resource operation."]
	quest.D792AB60A270CB8F.title: "Generation, Storage and Conduit Limits"
	quest.D792AB60A270CB8F.quest_desc: ["Ender IO generation and capacitors can coexist with other FE systems, but conduit tier remains the delivery boundary.","Separate generation from storage, protect restart energy, inspect connection limits and test simultaneous machine startup instead of one idle load."]
	quest.1056C1430DE2E2FD.title: "Soul Vials and Entity Permissions"
	quest.1056C1430DE2E2FD.quest_desc: ["Soul Vials and powered spawners turn captured entities into production inputs. Capturing a late mob can bypass dimension, boss or resource progression.","Classify allowed entities by stage, block bosses and permission carriers, contain spawns and audit every output against the resource-simulation policy."]
	quest.20CD87BCEE7B427B.title: "Farming Station Inputs and Tool Wear"
	quest.20CD87BCEE7B427B.quest_desc: ["Automated farming depends on seeds, tools, power and output space. Tool breakage or seed depletion can leave part of a field silently idle.","Reserve seeds and replacement tools, separate products, stop on overflow and verify complete replanting over two harvest cycles."]
	quest.16F1F75A6019BCAD.title: "Dark Steel Equipment and Upgrade Cost"
	quest.16F1F75A6019BCAD.quest_desc: ["Dark Steel equipment gains capabilities through upgrades and energy. Some upgrades can replace later movement, mining or protection systems.","Gate upgrade families by equivalent stages, account for energy and materials and prevent salvaging from producing more value than the original investment."]
	quest.60E8F7B3DDBE87A6.title: "Project: Serviceable Ender IO Factory"
	quest.60E8F7B3DDBE87A6.quest_desc: ["Build an Ender IO factory with automated alloy and grinding cells, multi-resource conduits, protected power and one stage-approved entity or farming system.","The project passes after two batches, documented channels, overflow shutdown, capacitor load audit and proof that no soul or equipment path bypasses progression."]
	quest.102263612B50B67B.title: "Machine Frames and Module Boundaries"
	quest.102263612B50B67B.quest_desc: ["RFTools is split across utility, storage, power and builder modules that share frames and components. A convenient side recipe can unlock several systems at once.","Keep frame recipes stage-aware, document which module consumes each component and remove alternate outputs only after a valid replacement is registered."]
	quest.AFC9A23D32E1AD0A.title: "Power Cells and Linked Capacity"
	quest.AFC9A23D32E1AD0A.quest_desc: ["Linked power cells create distributed storage whose capacity and transfer depend on tier and link configuration.","Protect recovery energy, label linked groups, verify input and output limits and prevent a remote optional load from draining the main industrial reserve."]
	quest.B1DFACF44385A448.title: "Builder Shapes and Area Ownership"
	quest.B1DFACF44385A448.quest_desc: ["The Builder can place, quarry or transform large regions according to cards and filters. A wrong offset or shape can affect far more blocks than expected.","Preview every area, restrict filters, reserve return storage, protect claimed structures and test with a small shape before enabling bulk work."]
	quest.E8B371972B4EC3E4.title: "Quarry Cards and Resource Policy"
	quest.E8B371972B4EC3E4.quest_desc: ["Quarry cards can become an early source of rare or progression-locked blocks if filters, dimension access or replacement behavior are unrestricted.","Gate quarry modes, exclude protected resources, bound region size and height, meter energy and ensure mined output cannot bypass the declared material stage."]
	quest.0D9ADA1E2B0DD838.title: "Storage Scanner and External Inventories"
	quest.0D9ADA1E2B0DD838.quest_desc: ["The Storage Scanner exposes many inventories through one interface. Overlapping ranges, wireless access and automation can create ambiguous ownership.","Label included inventories, exclude machine internals, reserve output space and verify the scanner cannot reveal or extract items from a later-stage protected area."]
	quest.05A74E63126B8825.title: "Matter Transmission and Destination Safety"
	quest.05A74E63126B8825.quest_desc: ["Matter transmitters and receivers turn energy and coordinates into travel. A remote destination without power or return equipment can strand the player.","Power both endpoints, verify dialing and ownership, keep recovery items outside the link and gate destinations whose travel would skip dimension progression."]
	quest.3EA3D74DAD2BFC21.title: "Environmental Controllers and Area Effects"
	quest.3EA3D74DAD2BFC21.quest_desc: ["Environmental Controllers apply modules over a configurable area and can replace armor, potions or hazard preparation if powerful effects arrive too early.","Gate modules by equivalent capability, bound radius, account for continuous energy and prevent overlapping controllers from creating unintended permanent buffs."]
	quest.8AD64FC4351232B3.title: "Screens and Operational Telemetry"
	quest.8AD64FC4351232B3.quest_desc: ["Screens can expose power, storage and machine state at a glance. Telemetry is useful only when it reports the variables that actually stop production.","Display reserves, fill levels, disabled states and bottleneck alarms; avoid decorative dashboards that hide a missing input or full output."]
	quest.FC4D5C581B4613AF.title: "Infusion and Machine Specialization"
	quest.FC4D5C581B4613AF.quest_desc: ["Machine infusion improves selected RFTools devices by consuming dimensional or technology materials. Infusion should strengthen an existing system, not unlock it before its stage.","Gate infusing materials, record performance before and after, preserve repair stock and compare upgraded machines with parallel uninfused alternatives."]
	quest.FAF9BF3E48206955.title: "Project: Bounded RFTools Infrastructure"
	quest.FAF9BF3E48206955.quest_desc: ["Build an RFTools system with linked energy, one previewed Builder task, controlled storage scanning and a safe transmitter route without protected-resource access.","The project passes after bounded-area verification, full-output recovery, protected destination checks, measured power demand and visible operational telemetry."]
	quest.3EED88ECCC6CF56F.title: "Flux Network Model"
	quest.3EED88ECCC6CF56F.quest_desc: ["Flux Networks separates named wireless networks from physical generators and consumers. A connection is easy to create, so ownership and purpose must be explicit.","Use one network per operational domain, name it clearly, document the controller and prevent personal or test devices from joining industrial reserves by default."]
	quest.4E7180D5A2886538.title: "Flux Plugs and Source Accounting"
	quest.4E7180D5A2886538.quest_desc: ["Flux Plugs insert power from external storage or generation. Several plugs can make total supply appear larger while sharing the same upstream bottleneck.","Label every source, record real input limits, avoid double-counting linked storage and verify one disabled plug does not hide a failing generator."]
	quest.0308E69D3C1F1BF7.title: "Flux Points and Consumer Boundaries"
	quest.0308E69D3C1F1BF7.quest_desc: ["Flux Points deliver power to machines or local storage. Unlimited-looking wireless delivery can obscure the actual demand of a machine group.","Assign points by subsystem, cap transfer where supported, monitor peak draw and keep optional loads outside the protected recovery network."]
	quest.BEBEB662D61241E7.title: "Wireless Storage and Reserve Layers"
	quest.BEBEB662D61241E7.quest_desc: ["Flux storage adds network-visible reserves. A large shared pool can let low-priority consumers drain power required for restart or containment.","Create operating, emergency and project reserves, expose their minimum levels and prevent wireless charging from crossing those boundaries."]
	quest.A3068A57B9499E32.title: "Priorities and Load Shedding"
	quest.A3068A57B9499E32.quest_desc: ["Priorities decide which devices retain power during shortage. Without a policy, convenience charging can compete equally with critical factories.","Define shutdown order, test a deliberate generation loss and verify containment, recovery and logistics remain powered before optional production."]
	quest.3F1ACD71C726396D.title: "Security, Ownership and Team Access"
	quest.3F1ACD71C726396D.quest_desc: ["Network ownership controls who can add devices or change settings. Incorrect public access can connect unintended loads or expose protected reserves.","Set team policy, audit members and public flags, keep administrative recovery access and document the owner before transferring a world or team."]
	quest.58C43F89AF86FF01.title: "Wireless Charging Scope"
	quest.58C43F89AF86FF01.quest_desc: ["Wireless charging can target players, armor and inventories across dimensions. Broad scope creates a hidden continuous load.","Restrict targets, reserve a charge budget, separate combat equipment from utility tools and verify interdimensional charging cannot bypass travel-stage energy planning."]
	quest.B7DAB4159578E796.title: "Chunk Availability and Remote Failure"
	quest.B7DAB4159578E796.quest_desc: ["Wireless links do not guarantee that remote generators, storage or machines are loaded and functioning. A point can remain connected to an unavailable source domain.","Document chunk assumptions, keep local fallback energy and test each remote network after a restart and after unloading its source area."]
	quest.1A766327F2CD5824.title: "Flux Diagnostics and Hidden Demand"
	quest.1A766327F2CD5824.quest_desc: ["A falling reserve should be traced through network input, output, wireless charging and per-point demand before more generation is added.","Record rates under idle and peak operation, disable consumers in order and compare controller totals with physical source and storage measurements."]
	quest.ACC46C1FC9046FBF.title: "Project: Protected Wireless Power Backbone"
	quest.ACC46C1FC9046FBF.quest_desc: ["Build separated Flux networks for critical industry, optional production and personal charging, with documented sources, points, storage and security.","The project passes after a generation-loss test, priority-based load shedding, restart from local reserve, team-access review and proof that no later-stage machine is powered early."]
	quest.FFCF4376A552A1FC.title: "Reactor Multiblock Fundamentals"
	quest.FFCF4376A552A1FC.quest_desc: ["Extreme Reactors uses formed structures whose size, ports, control rods and internal layout determine actual behavior.","Plan input, waste, power and coolant interfaces before construction, leave service access and verify the minimum structure before expanding."]
	quest.773DE13DF5BBF021.title: "Fuel Supply and Net Energy"
	quest.773DE13DF5BBF021.quest_desc: ["Reactor output depends on fuel supply and burn efficiency. A high instantaneous rate can waste fuel and create more heat than the system uses.","Measure energy per ingot, maintain startup fuel, stop insertion on full storage and compare several control-rod settings over complete burn intervals."]
	quest.D07525980E600544.title: "Waste Extraction and Reprocessing"
	quest.D07525980E600544.quest_desc: ["Spent fuel and waste products are part of the reactor material balance. Full waste storage can halt an otherwise healthy plant.","Extract automatically, reserve reprocessing capacity, expose fill levels and avoid conversions that return more useful fuel than the consumed material permits."]
	quest.512B0D27F21F6A85.title: "Cooling and Internal Layout"
	quest.512B0D27F21F6A85.quest_desc: ["Internal materials and fuel-rod spacing change heat transfer, efficiency and power density. More fuel rods are not automatically better.","Model at least two layouts, record temperature and consumption at steady state and choose a design with thermal margin instead of maximum short-term output."]
	quest.BB19A03964E967D4.title: "Control Rods and Automatic Regulation"
	quest.BB19A03964E967D4.quest_desc: ["Control rods trade reaction rate for efficiency and temperature. Fixed maximum output wastes fuel whenever demand falls.","Use storage thresholds or load signals, retain a safe default insertion and test controller loss so the reactor moves toward shutdown rather than uncontrolled output."]
	quest.4EE90118803F558C.title: "Active Cooling and Steam Production"
	quest.4EE90118803F558C.quest_desc: ["Actively cooled reactors convert heat into steam and shift the power plant boundary into fluid transport and turbine capacity.","Guarantee coolant return, buffer steam and water, interlock the reactor with downstream capacity and prevent a full steam destination from overheating or wasting fuel."]
	quest.56254468F4B42A0C.title: "Turbine Rotor and Coil Design"
	quest.56254468F4B42A0C.quest_desc: ["Turbine performance depends on blade count, rotor mass, coil material, steam flow and target RPM.","Tune one variable at a time, record steady RPM and output, protect overspeed conditions and size the reactor for the turbine rather than venting excess steam."]
	quest.8B98D91FAC43542A.title: "Scaling by Demand, Not Empty Space"
	quest.8B98D91FAC43542A.quest_desc: ["Large reactors and turbines impose block, chunk, fuel and control costs. Oversizing can reduce efficiency and obscure failures.","Scale from measured average and peak demand, preserve maintenance corridors and add modules only when storage discharge proves the current plant insufficient."]
	quest.55C0DF1FFA6091C0.title: "Plant Safety and Black Start"
	quest.55C0DF1FFA6091C0.quest_desc: ["A power plant must preserve enough external energy and fluid movement to restart after shutdown or control failure.","Maintain independent control power, define safe rod positions, test sensor loss and document the manual black-start sequence outside the plant network."]
	quest.A7A94CF51DB24093.title: "Project: Regulated Reactor-Turbine Plant"
	quest.A7A94CF51DB24093.quest_desc: ["Build a measured reactor or reactor-turbine plant with automatic fuel, waste, coolant, storage and control-rod management.","The project passes after a steady-state efficiency report, full-storage shutdown, waste-overflow protection, black-start test and proof that fuel processing respects progression."]
	quest.E094403E8FAC356D.title: "Apotheosis Capability Modules"
	quest.E094403E8FAC356D.quest_desc: ["Apotheosis changes enchanting, adventure loot, spawners, potions and equipment progression. These systems must be reviewed separately because each can bypass a different technology stage.","Document enabled modules, assign each capability to a progression boundary and avoid treating the entire mod as one unrestricted reward pool."]
	quest.CCEDCB0A1BBDDB01.title: "Enchanting Stats and Shelf Design"
	quest.CCEDCB0A1BBDDB01.quest_desc: ["Apotheosis enchanting uses several shelf statistics rather than only vanilla power. Maximum values can conflict or create expensive randomness.","Measure each statistic, design switchable shelf groups, keep a low-risk configuration and verify the setup does not grant endgame effects before equivalent production stages."]
	quest.87B71C72EB0956CE.title: "Affix Loot and Rarity Policy"
	quest.87B71C72EB0956CE.quest_desc: ["Affix equipment can provide large damage, defense, movement or utility jumps independent of crafted gear tiers.","Map rarity to progression, restrict overpowered attributes, audit boss and chest sources and prevent salvaging from creating more value than the item source requires."]
	quest.36FF267627BE9652.title: "Gems, Sockets and Build Intent"
	quest.36FF267627BE9652.quest_desc: ["Gems turn sockets into configurable power. Randomly installing the highest rarity can waste rare items or produce unintended capability combinations.","Define build intent, compare socket opportunity cost, preserve removal tools and gate gem effects that replace later flight, mining or damage systems."]
	quest.4FC480E0C2E5069A.title: "Reforging Cost and Selection"
	quest.4FC480E0C2E5069A.quest_desc: ["Reforging converts materials and randomness into affix outcomes. Repeated rerolls can consume more progression resources than the equipment is worth.","Set an acceptable result threshold, budget rerolls, preserve fallback gear and prevent cheap materials from rolling attributes intended for later stages."]
	quest.163E69FB388E813B.title: "Adventure Bosses and Controlled Rewards"
	quest.163E69FB388E813B.quest_desc: ["Apotheosis bosses are repeatable sources of affix gear and gems. Spawn rate and loot quality can dominate crafted combat progression.","Place boss tiers by dimension and stage, prevent farming permission items and keep the reward loop challenging without requiring hundreds of identical kills."]
	quest.118CDD7054858E58.title: "Spawner Modification and Entity Limits"
	quest.118CDD7054858E58.quest_desc: ["Spawner modifiers change delay, count, range, conditions and entity type. Combined upgrades can create severe entity load or bypass exploration.","Cap spawn rate and population, restrict entity replacement by stage, require overflow shutdown and verify no boss, seal carrier or rare dimension mob becomes an ordinary farm."]
	quest.D50441B6D96F5716.title: "Potion Extensions and Capability Boundaries"
	quest.D50441B6D96F5716.quest_desc: ["Extended potion levels and durations can replace armor, environmental preparation or machine safety systems when ingredients arrive too early.","Gate high effects by equivalent technology, account for renewable ingredient farms and prohibit automated loops that make permanent high-tier buffs effectively free."]
	quest.586AB17247EAAE41.title: "Salvaging and Value Conservation"
	quest.586AB17247EAAE41.quest_desc: ["Salvaging turns unwanted equipment into materials and can form positive loops with crafting, reforging, mob farms or EMC systems.","Compare input and expected output value, include energy and rarity cost, blacklist progression components and reject any repeatable net-positive loop."]
	quest.3443B0C4623099BB.title: "Project: Stage-Bounded Apotheosis Build"
	quest.3443B0C4623099BB.quest_desc: ["Create one documented equipment build using enchanting, affixes and gems while maintaining a stage-safe boss or spawner source and audited salvage policy.","The project passes after capability comparison with crafted gear, bounded entity load, no permission-item farming, recoverable gem choices and zero positive material loop."]
	chapter.07BDCB0129CEA24C.title: "Core Technology Manual V"
	quest.8A40FFCC5C5945D4.title: "Bee Types and Resource Permissions"
	quest.8A40FFCC5C5945D4.quest_desc: ["Each productive bee is a renewable permission for a material family. A bee obtained before its resource stage becomes a permanent bypass.","Classify every bee by output, dimension and parent requirements; block boss drops, seals and late materials until the corresponding stage is complete."]
	quest.943BC2306B8F8D00.title: "Breeding Trees and Parent Control"
	quest.943BC2306B8F8D00.quest_desc: ["Breeding paths form a dependency graph. Alternative parents, conversion items or wild spawns can skip the intended sequence.","Document parent pairs, remove duplicate early paths, preserve breeding stock and verify every advanced species depends on an already permitted material tier."]
	quest.BD17D80C058D6D00.title: "Advanced Hives and Population Design"
	quest.BD17D80C058D6D00.quest_desc: ["Hive productivity depends on bee count, weather behavior, upgrades, flowering conditions and output extraction.","Provide correct flowers, cap populations, separate species, expose blocked outputs and avoid dense arrays whose entity or tick cost exceeds their resource value."]
	quest.6BCB7A661DECE269.title: "Combs and Material Separation"
	quest.6BCB7A661DECE269.quest_desc: ["Comb outputs may look similar while representing different materials and processing routes. Mixed storage can feed the wrong centrifuge or recipe.","Route combs by exact type, preserve samples for breeding, cap low-value stock and stop hive extraction when the assigned processor cannot accept more."]
	quest.AC3AA114FD77F051.title: "Centrifuging and Secondary Products"
	quest.AC3AA114FD77F051.quest_desc: ["Centrifuges convert combs into primary resources, wax, honey and other secondary products. Any full output can halt the same batch.","Handle every output, measure net material per comb, reuse wax and honey deliberately and compare the bee route with machines, crops or mining."]
	quest.214CD0A52134C913.title: "Hive Upgrades and Scaling Cost"
	quest.214CD0A52134C913.quest_desc: ["Productivity, simulation and behavior upgrades change output and activity rules. Simulation upgrades can remove environmental constraints entirely.","Gate upgrade tiers, measure output before and after, account for tick cost and prohibit simulation for resources whose stage requires exploration or combat."]
	quest.A3CC45A2EC93A3E3.title: "Genes and Trait Selection"
	quest.A3CC45A2EC93A3E3.quest_desc: ["Gene systems let traits be extracted and applied across bees. Maximum productivity without species policy can multiply a balance error rapidly.","Separate gene stock, document trait sources, cap breeding experiments and verify transferred traits do not enable forbidden weather, dimension or simulation behavior."]
	quest.A4E4AE9328ED5895.title: "Bees, EMC and Seed Loops"
	quest.A4E4AE9328ED5895.quest_desc: ["Bee outputs can enter ProjectE, Mystical Agriculture, machine recipes and breeding, creating positive loops or duplicate renewable paths.","Compare all conversions, set zero EMC on gates, choose one authoritative renewable path per late material and reject closed net-positive loops."]
	quest.FF57B74803C723F8.title: "Apiary Diagnostics"
	quest.FF57B74803C723F8.quest_desc: ["A silent apiary should be checked for species, hive occupancy, flowering block, weather or simulation state, output capacity and processor backlog.","Inspect one hive at a time, preserve a known-good bee, test a small comb batch and avoid changing breeding, upgrades and logistics simultaneously."]
	quest.C082EF45CFDE1625.title: "Project: Stage-Safe Productive Apiary"
	quest.C082EF45CFDE1625.quest_desc: ["Build an apiary with at least four approved resource bees, complete comb processing, controlled upgrades and no simulated boss or permission output.","The project passes after two production cycles, breeding-tree audit, overflow shutdown, loop analysis and measured output compared with another renewable route."]
	quest.0351021E0E10E008.title: "Data Models as Entity Permissions"
	quest.0351021E0E10E008.quest_desc: ["A data model turns observed kills into a permanent simulation path for an entity. Creating the model early can bypass later dimension or boss access.","Classify every entity by stage, block bosses and permission carriers, require legitimate observation and keep model crafting outside random rewards or trades."]
	quest.C4E492FB7EF9EC3D.title: "Training and Accuracy Tiers"
	quest.C4E492FB7EF9EC3D.quest_desc: ["Model accuracy grows through real encounters before simulation becomes efficient. The training requirement should prove access without demanding hundreds of repetitive kills.","Use moderate kill counts, distinguish normal mobs from elites, keep boss models exceptional and explain which tier is sufficient for the intended output."]
	quest.2505CF4526D8D68A.title: "Simulation Chamber Inputs"
	quest.2505CF4526D8D68A.quest_desc: ["The Simulation Chamber consumes energy and prediction material to produce generalized predictions from trained models.","Buffer both inputs, expose model tier and progress, stop on full output and prohibit chambers from running models whose stage permission is not currently satisfied."]
	quest.1DF7CFCC119963EC.title: "Loot Fabrication and Output Policy"
	quest.1DF7CFCC119963EC.quest_desc: ["Loot Fabricators convert predictions into selected drops. The allowed output list defines whether the mod is convenient automation or a progression bypass.","Remove boss permissions, unique trophies and late materials, assign ordinary drops by stage and document every output with its original legitimate source."]
	quest.63FC9BE9A2BC8210.title: "Boss Models and Non-Simulatable Rewards"
	quest.63FC9BE9A2BC8210.quest_desc: ["A repeatable boss model can erase combat, arena and dimension requirements if it produces the same permission item as a real victory.","Permit only non-unique secondary drops when justified, never fabricate seals or progression trophies and keep first-victory quests as the sole permission source."]
	quest.007CA23F21CA951F.title: "Energy Cost and Parallel Chambers"
	quest.007CA23F21CA951F.quest_desc: ["Parallel chambers convert grid capacity into higher simulated loot throughput. Excessive scaling can make real farms and exploration irrelevant.","Measure energy per prediction, cap chamber count by stage, protect critical power reserves and compare simulated output with a physical farm before expansion."]
	quest.04DAFACEAAB534EC.title: "Model Storage and Ownership"
	quest.04DAFACEAAB534EC.quest_desc: ["Models carry training progress and access rights. Losing, duplicating or sharing a model can change who has permission to simulate an entity.","Store master models securely, use named working copies only when policy permits and audit team sharing after progression or membership changes."]
	quest.7BD07F194C5B0D45.title: "Simulation, EMC and Resource Loops"
	quest.7BD07F194C5B0D45.quest_desc: ["Fabricated drops may enter EMC, seeds, bees or machine recipes and create a positive resource loop independent of real encounters.","Set zero EMC on gates, compare prediction cost with output value and reject any closed loop that upgrades models or creates more prediction material than it consumes."]
	quest.0B2896A30AF551A6.title: "Simulation Diagnostics"
	quest.0B2896A30AF551A6.quest_desc: ["A stopped chamber should be checked for model tier, prediction material, energy, selected output, full inventory and stage policy.","Record one complete cycle, isolate the fabricator from the chamber and avoid changing model, energy and output rules simultaneously."]
	quest.9759625C0DB9CC24.title: "Project: Audited Neural Simulation Lab"
	quest.9759625C0DB9CC24.quest_desc: ["Build a lab with three stage-approved models, bounded chamber capacity and a fabricator policy that excludes bosses, seals and unique trophies.","The project passes after real-training proof, energy-per-drop calculation, output audit, loop analysis and a deliberate attempt to request a forbidden reward."]
	quest.2357B5028192FA75.title: "Factory Simulation Model"
	quest.2357B5028192FA75.quest_desc: ["Woot replaces live mob spawning with a structured factory that simulates an approved entity and its loot table.","Treat the factory as a resource simulator: require legitimate entity access, audit every drop and prohibit seals, unique trophies or progression permissions."]
	quest.6DD5E9B7834E8D96.title: "Factory Layout and Tier Structure"
	quest.6DD5E9B7834E8D96.quest_desc: ["Factory tiers use specific structures, controllers, cells and upgrades. A missing block or incorrect tier can leave the build visually plausible but inactive.","Build from a documented plan, verify each tier before adding upgrades and preserve maintenance access to the controller, power and output interfaces."]
	quest.DB23E1DC3446D17B.title: "Mob Learning and First Access"
	quest.DB23E1DC3446D17B.quest_desc: ["A simulated mob must first be encountered through the real world, dimension or encounter path. Capturing metadata should not replace the first legitimate kill.","Require stage-approved learning, separate normal mobs from bosses and keep the first-victory quest as the sole source of reusable permissions."]
	quest.242B6F6FE4E09623.title: "Loot Tables and Output Whitelists"
	quest.242B6F6FE4E09623.quest_desc: ["Simulated loot may include common drops, rare rolls, equipment and modded progression items. Copying the full table is not automatically balanced.","Whitelist ordinary outputs, exclude permissions and unique rewards, document rare chances and ensure every allowed item has already been accessible at that stage."]
	quest.6B25AECC339331F9.title: "Power Cost and Factory Scale"
	quest.6B25AECC339331F9.quest_desc: ["Higher-tier factories and upgrades convert more energy into simulated loot. Cheap unlimited power can make dimension and combat content irrelevant.","Measure energy per output, cap factory count by stage, protect industrial reserves and compare simulation with physical farms before scaling."]
	quest.48998CD20DE5FE0B.title: "Upgrades and Compound Multipliers"
	quest.48998CD20DE5FE0B.quest_desc: ["Rate, looting, efficiency and other upgrades multiply each other. Combining maximum values can exceed the balance of the original encounter by orders of magnitude.","Evaluate complete upgrade sets, gate looting and rate tiers, measure output after every change and preserve a safe low-power operating profile."]
	quest.14F4702CB5D67165.title: "Bulk Output and Overflow Control"
	quest.14F4702CB5D67165.quest_desc: ["A simulated factory can generate many item types without visible entities. Storage saturation may remain hidden until the exporter blocks the whole system.","Sort high-volume drops, cap low-value stock, provide a deliberate sink and shut down the factory before items are deleted or trapped internally."]
	quest.E7BEFA8E846F06D0.title: "Woot, EMC and Renewable Loops"
	quest.E7BEFA8E846F06D0.quest_desc: ["Simulated drops can feed EMC, seeds, bees or crafting and form a closed loop whose output finances more factories.","Set zero EMC on gates, compare energy and material cost with output value and reject loops that reproduce controllers, upgrades or permission resources."]
	quest.51ED95FF925A92D8.title: "Factory Diagnostics"
	quest.51ED95FF925A92D8.quest_desc: ["A stopped Woot factory should be checked for structure tier, learned entity, power, allowed output, upgrade compatibility and full exporter state.","Record one complete cycle, disable upgrades during diagnosis and compare controller status with external energy and storage measurements."]
	quest.FBCB9517D959B44E.title: "Project: Stage-Audited Woot Factory"
	quest.FBCB9517D959B44E.quest_desc: ["Build a Woot factory for one approved ordinary mob with bounded upgrades, measured energy and a complete output whitelist.","The project passes after real-access proof, two simulation batches, overflow shutdown, cross-mod loop review and a demonstrated rejection of a forbidden boss or seal output."]
	quest.76E382155F7E1499.title: "Mob Swabs and Entity Permissions"
	quest.76E382155F7E1499.quest_desc: ["Mob Swabs capture entity identity for later spawning recipes. Swabbing a late entity can bypass its dimension, encounter or boss gate.","Classify allowed entities, reject bosses and permission carriers, require legitimate access and audit every conversion from swab to spawn item."]
	quest.CA20AAD4361F7415.title: "Cursed Feed and Spawn Conversion"
	quest.CA20AAD4361F7415.quest_desc: ["Cursed feed converts captured entity data into a spawnable source. Recipe cost alone does not balance an entity that should remain dimension-locked.","Gate feed by entity stage, block bosses and unique mobs, prevent duplication through breeding or containers and document the permitted drop set."]
	quest.B50B56E1B2D39754.title: "Fans and Entity Flow"
	quest.B50B56E1B2D39754.quest_desc: ["Fans move mobs without consuming them and define the geometry of a grinder. Excess range or force can push entities outside containment or into unloaded boundaries.","Test one lane, cap range, protect player access and verify every mob reaches the intended processing point without accumulating in corners."]
	quest.586EAB39BFBA9379.title: "Mob Mashers and Upgrade Sets"
	quest.586EAB39BFBA9379.quest_desc: ["Mob Mashers apply damage and optional upgrades such as looting, beheading or smite. Combined upgrades can produce drops far beyond a normal encounter.","Gate upgrade tiers, measure kill rate and output, preserve containment and prohibit permission items even when looting would normally roll them."]
	quest.04B8BFBF5E0385D4.title: "Absorption Hoppers and Mixed Outputs"
	quest.04B8BFBF5E0385D4.quest_desc: ["Absorption Hoppers collect items and experience from an area. Full item or fluid storage can leave drops and orbs accumulating invisibly around the grinder.","Route items and experience separately, expose fill levels, stop spawning on either overflow and verify collection range does not steal from unrelated systems."]
	quest.E77063B933D117ED.title: "Experience Storage and Consumption"
	quest.E77063B933D117ED.quest_desc: ["Mob farms can turn experience into a bulk fluid or solid resource used by enchanting, machines and repairs.","Measure experience per kill, protect a recovery reserve, cap passive storage and avoid loops where experience improves the same farm faster than its external cost."]
	quest.D30A9C0D61B25055.title: "Population Limits and Failure States"
	quest.D30A9C0D61B25055.quest_desc: ["A grinder must stop spawning before containment, killing or storage fails. Otherwise entity count becomes the real output buffer.","Use population sensors or bounded spawning, test a disabled masher and full hopper, and verify the system returns to normal without manual entity cleanup."]
	quest.C46B17EFEB4BB5E6.title: "Bosses and Unique Drop Exclusion"
	quest.C46B17EFEB4BB5E6.quest_desc: ["A general mob grinder should not automate bosses, dimension permissions, unique quest entities or rare one-time artifacts.","Maintain an explicit blacklist, reject capture recipes, block permission drops and keep first victories and seals outside the farm economy."]
	quest.38D0528C08A26DE6.title: "Mob Farm Diagnostics"
	quest.38D0528C08A26DE6.quest_desc: ["A weak or stalled farm should be checked for spawn conditions, population cap, movement, kill speed, item collection, experience storage and chunk state.","Change one boundary at a time, count entities and outputs over a fixed interval and compare expected loot with actual filters before adding more spawns."]
	quest.D1B891A6627145D4.title: "Project: Bounded Physical Mob Farm"
	quest.D1B891A6627145D4.quest_desc: ["Build a physical farm for stage-approved ordinary mobs with controlled spawning, movement, killing, item collection and experience storage.","The project passes after a blocked-output test, population shutdown, output audit, no boss or permission path and measured entity and item rates."]
	quest.1EAB680A21B213CF.title: "Colony Planning and Spatial Budget"
	quest.1EAB680A21B213CF.quest_desc: ["MineColonies is a long-lived logistics system whose buildings, roads, work areas and chunk boundaries interact. Early placement errors become expensive migrations.","Survey terrain, reserve expansion corridors, separate industry from housing and document the intended production role before placing each core building."]
	quest.26C5819233EED85F.title: "Town Hall, Ownership and Colony Boundary"
	quest.26C5819233EED85F.quest_desc: ["The Town Hall establishes ownership, colony limits and administrative control. Moving or abandoning it affects every later worker and building.","Confirm team ownership, protect administrative access, record boundaries and avoid placing progression-critical machines where colony permissions can block recovery."]
	quest.1A515A2049671A25.title: "Builder Supply and Construction Queue"
	quest.1A515A2049671A25.quest_desc: ["Builders consume exact material lists over long jobs. Missing one decorative or processed block can stop a project while most materials remain unused.","Review the bill of materials, automate recurring blocks, stage supplies by project and keep one builder free for repairs instead of filling every queue with expansion."]
	quest.9A12D7A39C28AE53.title: "Warehouse and Inventory Ownership"
	quest.9A12D7A39C28AE53.quest_desc: ["The warehouse is the colony's shared material memory. Unsorted external insertion and unrestricted extraction can make workers compete with the player's factory.","Define import and export boundaries, reserve construction stock, expose shortages and keep progression-gated components outside automatic colony consumption unless explicitly approved."]
	quest.C6A2AED1B25AEE42.title: "Courier Capacity and Request Flow"
	quest.C6A2AED1B25AEE42.quest_desc: ["Couriers turn warehouse stock into delivered work. Too few couriers create hidden queues; too many cannot fix missing production or poor roads.","Measure outstanding requests, improve routes, assign priority buildings and verify that one blocked request does not prevent delivery to unrelated critical jobs."]
	quest.1C9A7EA5B58F1E3F.title: "Worker Chains and Internal Specialization"
	quest.1C9A7EA5B58F1E3F.quest_desc: ["Worker buildings form production chains: raw extraction, processing, crafting and delivery. One missing profession can force repeated manual intervention.","Map every colony recipe to a producer, keep tools and food supplied, compare internal throughput with external machines and avoid duplicate workers with no demand."]
	quest.68042445257A4272.title: "Research as Capability Progression"
	quest.68042445257A4272.quest_desc: ["University research grants colony-wide capability, capacity and efficiency. Research cost and duration should correspond to the infrastructure it improves.","Choose branches from measured bottlenecks, preserve research materials, document prerequisites and prevent colony research from unlocking player technology ahead of the main stage."]
	quest.DFF545EC1772CC25.title: "Food, Health and Workforce Stability"
	quest.DFF545EC1772CC25.quest_desc: ["Worker output depends on food, health, housing, tools and pathing. Production machines cannot compensate for citizens who spend most time recovering or walking.","Provide local food and medical supply, measure travel time, maintain tool stock and treat population stability as part of industrial capacity."]
	quest.92CCF54F9B6A019C.title: "Raids, Guards and Recovery Stock"
	quest.92CCF54F9B6A019C.quest_desc: ["Raids test colony layout, guard coverage and replacement logistics. A defense that consumes all industrial stock can win the battle and stop the colony.","Layer guard coverage, protect warehouse access, reserve replacement gear and define a post-raid repair queue before increasing colony size."]
	quest.0FA697624A124954.title: "Project: Self-Sustaining Industrial Colony"
	quest.0FA697624A124954.quest_desc: ["Build a colony district where warehouse, couriers, builders and at least three worker chains complete a construction project without direct item delivery by the player.","The project passes after request-flow measurement, protected progression stock, research audit, raid recovery plan and a second repeated construction using internal supply."]
	chapter.71210D65D4FE6EAC.title: "Core Technology Manual VI"
	quest.B02E028BAA12A04A.title: "Spellbooks, Glyphs and Capability Growth"
	quest.B02E028BAA12A04A.quest_desc: ["Ars Nouveau spells are assembled from forms, effects and augments. One newly unlocked glyph can change travel, mining, combat or automation capability.","Classify glyphs by equivalent technology stage, document each spell's purpose and keep a low-risk recovery spell separate from experimental combat chains."]
	quest.CA812976300AA565.title: "Source Generation and Buffering"
	quest.CA812976300AA565.quest_desc: ["Source is a production utility consumed by apparatus crafting, rituals and automation. A jar near one generator is not proof of sustained supply.","Measure source per cycle, separate generation from consumers, reserve restart capacity and stop expensive rituals before shared storage is exhausted."]
	quest.B6BE591E6CCC493C.title: "Enchanting Apparatus and Pedestal Recipes"
	quest.B6BE591E6CCC493C.quest_desc: ["The Enchanting Apparatus combines a central item, pedestal ingredients and Source. Missing or extra items can make a correct-looking setup fail.","Label pedestal groups, insert exact quantities, expose Source progress and recover unused ingredients after an incompatible recipe."]
	quest.4A196A9692D73E54.title: "Ritual Areas and Persistent Effects"
	quest.4A196A9692D73E54.quest_desc: ["Rituals apply large-area or long-duration effects and may consume Source continuously. Overlapping rituals can hide their true cost and capability.","Bound every area, label duration and upkeep, isolate experimental rituals and gate effects that replace later environmental, farming or travel systems."]
	quest.3409952ADD1BD33E.title: "Spell Turrets and Automated Casting"
	quest.3409952ADD1BD33E.quest_desc: ["Spell Turrets turn a spell into repeatable automation. Mining, breaking, placing or damaging effects can bypass machine and combat progression when unrestricted.","Assign one documented spell per turret, bound the target area, provide shutdown and exclude protected blocks, bosses and progression items."]
	quest.2B098E5B49CCD096.title: "Storage Lecterns and Inventory Scope"
	quest.2B098E5B49CCD096.quest_desc: ["Storage Lecterns expose connected inventories through a single interface. Broad scope can mix machine buffers, personal storage and protected progression stock.","Define included inventories, reserve output capacity, separate strategic items and test extraction after two stores contain the same material."]
	quest.1B42FB8DBE84AC2C.title: "Familiars and Passive Capability"
	quest.1B42FB8DBE84AC2C.quest_desc: ["Familiars grant passive bonuses or automate specific tasks. Their effects persist beyond the ritual that summoned them.","Document ownership and effect, gate capability-equivalent familiars, provide dismissal and prevent passive bonuses from replacing a later gear or utility stage."]
	quest.430071BF9225B988.title: "Mage Equipment and Thread Selection"
	quest.430071BF9225B988.quest_desc: ["Mage equipment and threads shape mana, defense and spell behavior. Stacking maximum utility can produce movement or protection beyond the current stage.","Choose a role, compare thread opportunity cost, keep recovery gear and gate effects equivalent to flight, invulnerability or high-area mining."]
	quest.E8B90B4D324E8E32.title: "Ars Diagnostics and Linking"
	quest.E8B90B4D324E8E32.quest_desc: ["A stopped Ars system should be checked for Source, ownership, linked inventories, selected spell, target area and redstone state.","Inspect one link at a time, preserve a known-good configuration and test with a bounded spell or single-item recipe before changing the full network."]
	quest.F5761FAC36750623.title: "Project: Bounded Arcane Automation Lab"
	quest.F5761FAC36750623.quest_desc: ["Build an Ars lab with measured Source generation, one automated Apparatus recipe, one bounded ritual and one stage-safe Spell Turret or familiar.","The project passes after two repeated crafts, Source reserve verification, area audit, safe shutdown and proof that no spell bypasses protected resources or travel stages."]
	quest.DE031F83E742B81E.title: "Dictionary, Spirit Tiers and Ritual Order"
	quest.DE031F83E742B81E.quest_desc: ["Occultism progresses through spirit tiers, chalks, ritual structures and bound entities. The Dictionary of Spirits is the authoritative process map.","Read the required spirit and ritual before collecting components, label ritual spaces and avoid using add-on recipes that summon a higher tier from lower-tier materials."]
	quest.7DCF4DC13B33DD7F.title: "Chalk Types and Ritual Geometry"
	quest.7DCF4DC13B33DD7F.quest_desc: ["Ritual diagrams require exact chalk types, orientation and unobstructed blocks. One wrong glyph can make a complete ingredient set appear invalid.","Build dedicated marked pads, preserve line visibility, store chalk by tier and verify geometry before placing expensive sacrifice items."]
	quest.822EB4AA3B06FA80.title: "Summoning Safety and Ownership"
	quest.822EB4AA3B06FA80.quest_desc: ["Summoned spirits may become workers, tools, familiars or hostile entities. Ownership and containment determine whether the ritual creates infrastructure or a recovery problem.","Prepare containment, dismissal and replacement items, record the bound owner and never summon an entity whose capability belongs to a later stage."]
	quest.944F33094ED20ABB.title: "Dimensional Storage and Stable Access"
	quest.944F33094ED20ABB.quest_desc: ["Occultism storage separates a controller, dimensional capacity and access interfaces. Losing the controller or remote link can hide the only recovery tools.","Keep external emergency storage, document capacity upgrades, restrict remote access and reserve output space for automated workers."]
	quest.932A245BB29136DC.title: "Dimensional Mineshaft and Resource Policy"
	quest.932A245BB29136DC.quest_desc: ["Dimensional miners produce ores without ordinary world extraction. Their allowed outputs and spirit tier determine whether exploration stages remain meaningful.","Whitelist resources by progression, exclude boss and dimension permissions, meter operating cost and compare the miner with physical and industrial extraction."]
	quest.BADC61A84740092E.title: "Spirit Crushing and Yield Comparison"
	quest.BADC61A84740092E.quest_desc: ["Crusher spirits convert ores and materials through a bound worker whose tier changes speed and yield.","Measure complete batches, route every output, preserve replacement summoning materials and compare net yield with Mekanism, MI and other processing paths."]
	quest.9DBE8E1B1F03F4F0.title: "Spirit Jobs and Failure Recovery"
	quest.9DBE8E1B1F03F4F0.quest_desc: ["Bound spirits perform transport, storage, crushing or other jobs. A lost or unloaded worker can silently stop a chain whose inventories remain full.","Name workers by role, expose job inputs and outputs, keep replacement ritual stock and test recovery after removing one worker from the system."]
	quest.0A8D8A2788006A77.title: "Familiars and Permanent Capability"
	quest.0A8D8A2788006A77.quest_desc: ["Familiars provide passive effects, utility or protection beyond the ritual itself. Their capability can replace equipment or environmental preparation.","Gate familiar types by equivalent stage, document owner and effect, keep dismissal available and prevent transfer from becoming an early team-wide unlock."]
	quest.6BB50C881221AE34.title: "Occultism and Cross-Mod Resource Loops"
	quest.6BB50C881221AE34.quest_desc: ["Dimensional mining, crushing and storage may feed EMC, bees, seeds or machine recipes and create duplicate renewable paths.","Choose authoritative routes for late materials, set zero EMC on gates and reject loops that reproduce summoning components or higher-tier spirits at net gain."]
	quest.2953BE744A4B0D59.title: "Project: Audited Spirit Workshop"
	quest.2953BE744A4B0D59.quest_desc: ["Build an Occultism workshop with dedicated ritual pads, dimensional storage and one stage-approved worker for crushing, transport or mining.","The project passes after ownership audit, recovery test, output whitelist, two repeated jobs and proof that no spirit, familiar or mine bypasses a later permission."]
	quest.8DA6F2AFDA365CF3.title: "Boss Structures and Expedition Planning"
	quest.8DA6F2AFDA365CF3.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm bosses are tied to large structures, environmental hazards and long approach routes. Reaching the arena is part of the encounter infrastructure.","Record coordinates, secure a return path, place recovery storage outside destructive range and avoid mining shortcuts that bypass intended structure progression."]
	quest.51C4FE6C2FDA955D.title: "Readiness, Damage Types and Recovery"
	quest.51C4FE6C2FDA955D.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm encounters combine heavy melee, projectiles, area attacks, terrain control and phase changes. Raw armor alone does not answer every failure mode.","Prepare mobility, ranged and close options, healing, repair stock and a retreat threshold; keep one complete replacement set outside the arena."]
	quest.469DCA96F7AB0DAE.title: "Boss Phases and Pattern Learning"
	quest.469DCA96F7AB0DAE.quest_desc: ["Boss phases change attacks, vulnerability and arena pressure. Damage racing can skip learning but becomes unreliable after balance changes.","Observe one full cycle, identify telegraphs and safe responses, record phase transitions and tune equipment only after the mechanical cause of failure is understood."]
	quest.DFC2A3DB6C9B5E7A.title: "Arena Integrity and Destructive Attacks"
	quest.DFC2A3DB6C9B5E7A.quest_desc: ["Some encounters alter terrain, create hazards or punish confinement. Overbuilding the arena can remove intended movement or trap the player with the boss.","Preserve escape lanes, protect only essential recovery points, avoid invulnerable cheese structures and test the arena without carrying unique progression items."]
	quest.62E45C0FCE05F145.title: "Boss Drops and Technology Permissions"
	quest.62E45C0FCE05F145.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm drops often unlock powerful equipment or recipes. A loot simulator, quest reward or trade can erase the encounter requirement.","Classify every unique drop, keep first-victory evidence outside ordinary farms, set zero EMC where required and consume only repeatable materials in mass recipes."]
	quest.DFC97890391C724D.title: "Cataclysm Equipment and Capability Jumps"
	quest.DFC97890391C724D.quest_desc: ["Boss equipment can grant mobility, damage, defense or environmental capability beyond ordinary crafted tiers.","Map each item to a stage, compare with Draconic and Apotheosis gear, preserve repair materials and block salvaging or duplication loops."]
	quest.ECECBCA08DA5FE6C.title: "Rematches and Fair Repeatability"
	quest.ECECBCA08DA5FE6C.quest_desc: ["Some late recipes need repeatable boss materials. Repeating a long structure search is different from repeating a mastered encounter.","Provide a controlled rematch path after the first victory, preserve resource and energy cost, prevent automatic killing and keep unique permissions non-consumable."]
	quest.2C1AE280BA7E9B1C.title: "Modeled Health and TTK Targets"
	quest.2C1AE280BA7E9B1C.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm bosses use the highest pack combat profile, but difficulty should come from mechanics and pressure rather than an endless health bar.","Keep theoretical TTK inside the declared range, compare real phase duration and adjust health, damage and armor together instead of multiplying only HP."]
	quest.AE7B262D87786857.title: "Boss Farm Exclusion"
	quest.AE7B262D87786857.quest_desc: ["Woot, neural models, swabs, spawners and generic mob farms can attempt to reproduce Cataclysm entities or drops.","Blacklist bosses and unique outputs across every simulator, allow ordinary secondary materials only after review and keep progression seals or trophies first-victory only."]
	quest.7FF6EAFAD707E675.title: "Project: Documented Cataclysm Expedition"
	quest.7FF6EAFAD707E675.quest_desc: ["Complete one major Cataclysm encounter with a prepared route, recovery cache, recorded phases and an audited plan for every drop.","The project passes after a successful return, no terrain cheese, no simulated unique loot, measured combat duration and a fair rematch strategy if repeat materials are needed."]
	quest.E33A44A9832B4601.title: "Portal Entry and Safe Hub"
	quest.E33A44A9832B4601.quest_desc: ["The Twilight Forest is a progression dimension with biome locks, structures and ordered bosses. A safe portal hub prevents every expedition from becoming a recovery gamble.","Mark coordinates, protect both sides, store food and replacement gear outside the portal and test return before carrying trophies or unique materials."]
	quest.684CA77EFFC48184.title: "Biome Locks and Boss Order"
	quest.684CA77EFFC48184.quest_desc: ["Biome hazards and structure access encode the intended boss sequence. Removing protections or entering by teleport can expose later resources without the required victories.","Keep progression enforcement enabled, explain each unlock and block cross-mod travel tools from skipping the first legitimate entry into protected regions."]
	quest.DC2791D2A4DB470F.title: "Maps, Landmarks and Route Planning"
	quest.DC2791D2A4DB470F.quest_desc: ["Magic maps reveal structure regions but do not replace terrain preparation, safe paths and return logistics.","Mark completed and pending structures, build protected waypoints, preserve spare maps and avoid carrying the only route information into a boss arena."]
	quest.EC56BA4762055A61.title: "Boss Sequence and Readiness"
	quest.EC56BA4762055A61.quest_desc: ["Naga, Lich, Minoshroom, Hydra and later bosses test different movement, arena and damage responses. One universal equipment set is rarely optimal.","Prepare encounter-specific tools, record mechanics, define retreat conditions and keep one replacement set at the last safe waypoint."]
	quest.15871A7863D6D330.title: "Trophies, Unlocks and Non-Consumable Proof"
	quest.15871A7863D6D330.quest_desc: ["Trophies prove boss completion and may be decorative or used by original progression. Mass-consuming them in technical recipes creates unfair rematches.","Store original trophies, use reusable permission items for repeated cross-mod crafting and prevent loot, EMC or simulation copies."]
	quest.58F2D9A7CF969CC7.title: "Dimension Materials and Industrial Use"
	quest.58F2D9A7CF969CC7.quest_desc: ["Fiery, Knightmetal, Carminite and other materials represent different structures and boss tiers. Treating them as one generic Twilight resource erases progression.","Assign each material to its first legitimate structure, document processing and keep simulators, seeds and bees locked until that tier is complete."]
	quest.CC5077472AAFA8D3.title: "Structure Loot and Uncrafting Risk"
	quest.CC5077472AAFA8D3.quest_desc: ["Structure chests and uncrafting systems can expose components or reverse recipes in ways that bypass intended material costs.","Audit high-value loot, restrict uncrafting outputs, include repair or XP cost and reject any reversible recipe that yields more gated material than the source required."]
	quest.6E7100E82745E497.title: "Twilight Equipment and Capability Matching"
	quest.6E7100E82745E497.quest_desc: ["Twilight equipment provides fire effects, special protection, durability and utility tied to boss and structure progression.","Map each set to a stage, compare with crafted tech gear, preserve repair materials and prevent salvaging or trading from granting later sets early."]
	quest.DE564FC204574A2C.title: "Twilight Progression and Cross-Mod Gates"
	quest.DE564FC204574A2C.quest_desc: ["Twilight victories can prove combat and exploration readiness for selected technology jumps without becoming mandatory ingredients in every machine.","Use a small number of reusable permissions, explain the matching technology domain and never let Twilight farming replace DivineRPG seals or other independent gates."]
	quest.732C2D6974BD470F.title: "Project: Documented Twilight Campaign"
	quest.732C2D6974BD470F.quest_desc: ["Complete a contiguous Twilight progression segment with mapped structures, safe routes, encounter notes, sorted resources and preserved trophies.","The project passes when biome order is respected, no travel tool skips a first entry, resource simulators remain stage-safe and the return path works after a restart."]
	quest.C0282DF03AF50C55.title: "Bestiary and Threat Classification"
	quest.C0282DF03AF50C55.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire contains dragons, mythical predators, structures and tameable creatures with very different risks and rewards. The Bestiary is the operational reference.","Classify each creature by habitat, threat, drops and taming route before building farms or carrying valuable equipment into its territory."]
	quest.DC7CE7577427E2BC.title: "Dragon Stages and Encounter Scale"
	quest.DC7CE7577427E2BC.quest_desc: ["Dragon age changes health, damage, size, breath range and drop value. Treating all dragons as one mob tier creates severe combat and loot imbalance.","Separate surface and den encounters, scale preparation by stage and prevent generic spawners or simulators from flattening age progression."]
	quest.BCB8E2A9B8A0E60A.title: "Dragon Combat and Elemental Protection"
	quest.BCB8E2A9B8A0E60A.quest_desc: ["Dragon combat combines flight, breath, melee, terrain damage and large pursuit distance. A high-damage weapon without mobility or resistance is unreliable.","Prepare element-specific protection, ranged pressure, cover and retreat, keep replacement equipment outside the den and define a safe loot-recovery route."]
	quest.3E6AA180A5719BFB.title: "Scales, Blood, Bones and Stage Policy"
	quest.3E6AA180A5719BFB.quest_desc: ["Dragon drops unlock armor, weapons and Dragonforge production. Their availability must reflect the dragon stage and first legitimate victory.","Separate materials by element and age, keep unique eggs outside ordinary loot simulation and block EMC, seeds, bees and generic mob farms until the matching stage."]
	quest.4420A580D54CDCC2.title: "Dragon Eggs and Ownership"
	quest.4420A580D54CDCC2.quest_desc: ["Dragon eggs are rare persistent capability items, not bulk resources. Hatching creates a long-term entity with ownership and growth requirements.","Store eggs securely, document owner and element, prepare containment and food before hatching and prevent cloning, loot rewards or simulation copies."]
	quest.25BA3546DCBD58BA.title: "Taming, Growth and Entity Safety"
	quest.25BA3546DCBD58BA.quest_desc: ["Tamed dragons grow, consume food, occupy large space and can damage structures or entities. Ownership does not remove operational risk.","Build a dedicated area, control growth and wandering, keep recall tools accessible and verify a lost or unloaded dragon cannot block the only progression route."]
	quest.93CF7BDB95FF71F2.title: "Dragonforge Structure and Breath Supply"
	quest.93CF7BDB95FF71F2.quest_desc: ["The Dragonforge combines a formed structure, elemental breath, input materials and a live dragon. It is an industrial-biological multiblock.","Secure the dragon, align the forge, automate item handling without trapping breath access and keep element-specific infrastructure separated."]
	quest.6CA6FBD598FCD646.title: "Mythical Creatures and Unique Counters"
	quest.6CA6FBD598FCD646.quest_desc: ["Gorgons, cyclopes, sea serpents, hydras and other creatures use mechanics that differ from dragon combat and may punish ordinary gear assumptions.","Read the Bestiary, prepare the specific counter, store unique drops separately and prohibit generic farming of one-time or capability-defining rewards."]
	quest.A3620F0538826BEE.title: "World Damage, Dens and Base Distance"
	quest.A3620F0538826BEE.quest_desc: ["Dragon dens and large creatures affect terrain, structures and nearby entities. Building critical factories too close creates a persistent disaster risk.","Survey before settlement, maintain buffer distance, protect only recovery infrastructure and avoid removing encounter terrain in ways that trivialize future fights."]
	quest.6CA82E915ED7ADA3.title: "Project: Controlled Dragon Industry"
	quest.6CA82E915ED7ADA3.quest_desc: ["Complete one legitimate dragon encounter, preserve and classify its drops, then operate one element-specific Dragonforge or safe taming facility.","The project passes after combat documentation, no simulated egg or unique drop, safe entity containment, repeatable forge output and a verified return and recovery route."]
	chapter.AC3B17F6F034C9C9.title: "Core Technology Manual II"
	quest.E86D0E212E4572D3.title: "Pressure as Stored Work"
	quest.E86D0E212E4572D3.quest_desc: ["Pressure networks store compressed air, and every machine changes both pressure and available air volume. A high gauge reading in one small pipe is not the same as a stable production reserve.","Separate generation, storage and consumers; measure recovery after a full machine cycle and keep normal operation below the component pressure limit."]
	quest.A46B956681010564.title: "Compression, Heat and Efficiency"
	quest.A46B956681010564.quest_desc: ["Compressors convert fuel or power into pressure while producing heat. Excess temperature reduces efficiency and can turn a simple supply problem into a thermal shutdown.","Provide heat rejection, fuel or energy buffering and a pressure-controlled stop; compare useful air produced per input rather than judging only fill speed."]
	quest.C7AEEF080C1C4D75.title: "Safety Valves and Network Segmentation"
	quest.C7AEEF080C1C4D75.quest_desc: ["Pressure limits differ between components. One weak tube or machine can define the safe ceiling of an otherwise advanced network.","Use safety modules and shutoff valves, label pressure classes, isolate test branches and verify that one fault cannot vent the entire factory reserve."]
	quest.DFB43C0EB0B17931.title: "Pressure Chamber Throughput"
	quest.DFB43C0EB0B17931.quest_desc: ["The Pressure Chamber is a multiblock batch processor whose real speed depends on chamber volume, target pressure, input routing and output extraction.","Keep item paths one-way, expose pressure and inventory state, prevent finished items from re-entering and test a full batch without opening the chamber manually."]
	quest.1AB40A3FE27D565D.title: "Oil, Refining and Plastic"
	quest.1AB40A3FE27D565D.quest_desc: ["Plastic production links crude inputs, temperature control, refinery outputs and solidification. Ignoring one fraction can block the whole refinery.","Plan storage for every fluid, stabilize heat before bulk operation and reserve plastic for circuits and machines instead of optional decoration."]
	quest.F9293E0FB90DA06C.title: "Etching and Circuit Quality"
	quest.F9293E0FB90DA06C.quest_desc: ["Printed circuit boards require a timed etching process and careful handling of unfinished boards. They are a production permission, not a random loot substitute.","Use bounded batches, track etching progress, protect finished boards from the etchant and maintain a reserve for rebuilding pressure-control infrastructure."]
	quest.58034A9FB4D6267B.title: "Logistics Frames and Drones"
	quest.58034A9FB4D6267B.quest_desc: ["Pneumatic logistics can request, provide and transport items through programmable frames or drones. Broad requests easily create loops and competing destinations.","Give each route ownership, exact filters, stock limits and a failure destination; test missing items and blocked inventories before unattended operation."]
	quest.5BDBB1906C74FEB6.title: "Drone Programs and Safe Areas"
	quest.5BDBB1906C74FEB6.quest_desc: ["Drones execute ordered programs and can interact with areas larger than expected when coordinates, filters or conditions are ambiguous.","Start with a restricted test area, provide charging and recovery, document every branch and ensure a stopped drone cannot leave a critical process permanently locked."]
	quest.0267778222F67B52.title: "Pneumatic Diagnostics"
	quest.0267778222F67B52.quest_desc: ["A stopped pneumatic machine should be checked for local pressure, network volume, heat, side configuration, item state and redstone control in that order.","Record gauge values before changing pipes, isolate one branch at a time and reproduce the fault with a small batch instead of venting the whole network."]
	quest.B899290FFDF02799.title: "Project: Safe Pressure Factory"
	quest.B899290FFDF02799.quest_desc: ["Build a factory that generates and stores pressure, runs a Pressure Chamber and produces plastic or circuits through controlled thermal and item systems.","The project passes after two repeated batches, safe overpressure protection, visible heat and pressure margins, automatic output handling and recovery from a blocked destination."]
	quest.349D58AB6074A6CD.title: "Latex and Plastic Foundation"
	quest.349D58AB6074A6CD.quest_desc: ["Industrial Foregoing begins with tree fluid extraction, latex buffering and plastic production. One slow extractor should not define the permanent rate of the entire mod.","Measure fluid per tree, scale extraction before consumers, buffer water and latex separately and stop processing when plastic storage is full."]
	quest.987A87132F9EED76.title: "Machine Frames as Stage Standards"
	quest.987A87132F9EED76.quest_desc: ["Machine frames represent increasing material, circuit and process capability. Receiving an advanced frame through loot or a quest reward bypasses an industrial stage.","Produce every frame through the declared route, retain reusable engineering standards and audit add-ons that introduce alternative frame recipes."]
	quest.A1B44CF3018B552A.title: "Working Areas and Chunk Boundaries"
	quest.A1B44CF3018B552A.quest_desc: ["Many IF machines operate over configurable areas. Oversized or overlapping regions waste power, duplicate work and hide chunk-loading assumptions.","Visualize every area, avoid accidental overlap, keep critical inventories loaded and document which machine owns each block or entity region."]
	quest.F6F2257FE367CC3B.title: "Plant Automation and Sludge"
	quest.F6F2257FE367CC3B.quest_desc: ["Plant production combines sowing, gathering, fertilizer, item routing and sludge or other secondary outputs. The harvester alone is not a complete farm.","Balance replanting stock, route products by type, process or store sludge and verify one full crop cycle without manual seed replacement."]
	quest.0647ED50C4FC3FE8.title: "Animal Machines and Population Control"
	quest.0647ED50C4FC3FE8.quest_desc: ["Breeding, feeding, ranching and slaughter machines can grow populations faster than outputs are handled, creating entity load and blocked inventories.","Set population limits, separate breeding stock, handle every product and prove that a full output stops breeding before entity count rises."]
	quest.17650B9616DBACC3.title: "Mob Processing and Essence"
	quest.17650B9616DBACC3.quest_desc: ["Mob processing converts controlled spawns into drops and essence. It must not become an early source of boss permissions or progression-locked materials.","Use explicit entity filters, contain spawns, buffer essence and drops, disable the system on overflow and audit every simulated entity against stage policy."]
	quest.81C65F3863192E87.title: "Fluid Recipes and Dissolution"
	quest.81C65F3863192E87.quest_desc: ["IF fluid machines combine item ratios, fluid inputs and reusable molds or components. A wrong side or full secondary tank can silently halt the line.","Label all sides, preserve reusable items, calculate fluid per batch and stop upstream production before either item or fluid output saturates."]
	quest.D9910DBCFA123B22.title: "Laser Drilling and Ore Policy"
	quest.D9910DBCFA123B22.quest_desc: ["Laser drills are configurable renewable resource generators whose lenses and location rules can bypass exploration or material stages if unrestricted.","Define allowed outputs by stage, restrict late ores, meter power cost, provide overflow and compare drilling with existing extraction before scaling."]
	quest.EE4E8A017E9E2FF9.title: "Essence, Enchanting and Books"
	quest.EE4E8A017E9E2FF9.quest_desc: ["Enchanting machines convert essence, items and books through specialized steps. Random output can consume substantial resources without improving the intended equipment.","Separate extraction, sorting and application, recycle unwanted books only through a bounded policy and reserve essence for mandatory production."]
	quest.70ED936789C62049.title: "Project: Closed-Loop Bioindustry"
	quest.70ED936789C62049.quest_desc: ["Build an IF complex that produces plastic, runs one plant or animal line and processes every fluid and secondary output without unrestricted resource simulation.","The project passes after two cycles, bounded working areas, verified frame stages, overflow shutdown and documented power and fluid balances."]
	quest.D635AC31AADD3076.title: "Tier Model and Shared Components"
	quest.D635AC31AADD3076.quest_desc: ["Powah uses recurring capacitors, crystals and previous-tier machines. Skipping one tier through loot or conversion undermines the intended energy progression.","Stock shared components, preserve previous-tier equipment for upgrades and verify every high-tier recipe depends on the declared resonant stage."]
	quest.D46C81996789B031.title: "Generators and Fuel Economics"
	quest.D46C81996789B031.quest_desc: ["Powah generators convert different fuels or conditions into energy. Nominal output is insufficient without supply reliability, waste handling and operating cost.","Measure energy per consumed resource, keep startup stock and choose generators that match renewable inputs instead of forcing one scarce fuel into every load."]
	quest.960EB35051288D03.title: "Thermo Generators and Coolant"
	quest.960EB35051288D03.quest_desc: ["Thermo generators depend on a heat source and coolant quality. Their steady output is useful only while the coolant route remains reliable.","Use a renewable coolant supply, protect against empty input, compare heat blocks and confirm the generator restarts after a temporary fluid interruption."]
	quest.A403F77708CCDAF8.title: "Energizing Recipes and Rod Scaling"
	quest.A403F77708CCDAF8.quest_desc: ["Energizing recipes consume a defined energy total, while rod count controls transfer rate. More rods shorten time but increase peak grid demand.","Buffer the required energy before a batch, prevent partial starvation, scale rods from measured capacity and route completed items without re-entry."]
	quest.501B9C3D253144B5.title: "Energy Cells and Reserve Policy"
	quest.501B9C3D253144B5.quest_desc: ["Energy cells separate generation from demand and can form tiered reserves. A large empty cell does not solve insufficient generation or transfer.","Define a minimum reserve, protect recovery power, observe charge and discharge rates and keep high-tier storage behind the matching progression gate."]
	quest.C9A4C89AC3C0B87B.title: "Cables and Transfer Limits"
	quest.C9A4C89AC3C0B87B.quest_desc: ["Cable tier and connection configuration limit actual delivery. Generators and cells can be full while a consumer starves behind an undersized segment.","Label trunk tiers, inspect every connection, isolate high-pulse machines and test simultaneous demand rather than one idle consumer."]
	quest.9177A816706064BD.title: "Player Transmitters and Binding"
	quest.9177A816706064BD.quest_desc: ["Player transmitters provide convenient wireless charging but can silently drain the same reserve that supports critical automation.","Bind deliberately, filter equipment when possible, set a protected energy floor and verify personal charging cannot shut down recovery systems."]
	quest.B590ECE826D27E07.title: "Reactors and Multi-Input Balance"
	quest.B590ECE826D27E07.quest_desc: ["Powah reactors combine several consumables and cooling inputs. Missing one component reduces output or stops the system despite full stores of the others.","Maintain independent stock thresholds, expose limiting inputs, protect restart inventory and gate Nitro construction behind the resonant standard."]
	quest.3C0D8E1495DC77C9.title: "Energy Diagnostics and Load Shedding"
	quest.3C0D8E1495DC77C9.quest_desc: ["An energy network should identify whether failure begins at generation, storage, transfer or demand. Adding a generator without diagnosis can hide a cable bottleneck.","Record rates, disconnect optional loads in a defined order and test black-start recovery from an empty network."]
	quest.FBCBBD66E2FA26A4.title: "Project: Tiered Resilient Power Grid"
	quest.FBCBBD66E2FA26A4.quest_desc: ["Build a Powah grid with two generation methods, staged storage, protected recovery reserve and one controlled energizing line.","The project passes when simultaneous loads remain supplied, a failed generator triggers load shedding, the grid restarts from empty and Nitro stays stage-gated."]
	quest.5EF725744BA4F800.title: "EMC Is an Accounting System"
	quest.5EF725744BA4F800.quest_desc: ["EMC converts approved matter values, so every assigned value is a balance decision. A positive value on a progression gate becomes a direct bypass.","Treat the custom EMC blacklist as authoritative, review new modded values and never assume an expensive recipe remains meaningful after transmutation."]
	quest.017BDF28BB205224.title: "Philosopher's Stone Permission"
	quest.017BDF28BB205224.quest_desc: ["The Philosopher's Stone is both a crafting catalyst and an access key. Granting it early unlocks many conversions beyond its own recipe.","Require draconic and dimensional standards, return it as a container item where appropriate and audit every recipe that accepts it."]
	quest.2B28C7D85FC5398A.title: "Transmutation Table Access"
	quest.2B28C7D85FC5398A.quest_desc: ["The table turns learned items into persistent conversion access. Its recipe and EMC value must not bypass contained transmutation.","Gate it behind the transmutation matrix, set EMC to zero and verify quest rewards, loot and alternate tables do not provide equivalent access."]
	quest.FE6B40F1FE0FC3B6.title: "Collectors and Passive EMC"
	quest.FE6B40F1FE0FC3B6.quest_desc: ["Energy collectors generate EMC passively and can turn elapsed time into unrestricted matter. Scaling them changes the entire resource economy.","Gate tiers, measure EMC per hour, prevent early self-replication and compare passive generation with active factories before approving arrays."]
	quest.432CF4F9AA1C9692.title: "Relays and EMC Throughput"
	quest.432CF4F9AA1C9692.quest_desc: ["Relays move and amplify collector networks. Their tier determines whether passive generation can feed condensers faster than intended.","Design bounded networks, expose throughput, avoid hidden recursive layouts and keep high relay tiers behind the same matter stage as their outputs."]
	quest.5CEFEF4147E58758.title: "Condensers and Target Control"
	quest.5CEFEF4147E58758.quest_desc: ["Condensers transform EMC into a selected item. A wrong target or unrestricted input can consume strategic resources or manufacture gated outputs.","Whitelist targets by stage, protect catalyst slots, cap input and verify no blacklist item can be selected or indirectly produced."]
	quest.222869AB7B2F40D3.title: "Matter Tiers and Infrastructure Cost"
	quest.222869AB7B2F40D3.quest_desc: ["Dark and red matter should represent accumulated late infrastructure, not a lucky loot reward or trivial condenser target.","Require contained EMC systems, cross-mod components and documented production capacity while keeping the process automatable after mastery."]
	quest.6AD08C917F49951A.title: "Klein Stars and Portable Reserves"
	quest.6AD08C917F49951A.quest_desc: ["Klein Stars move stored EMC into tools and machines. Portable reserves can bypass intended energy or matter limitations when charged too early.","Gate star tiers, separate emergency and production reserves and audit machines that charge or drain them for unintended loops."]
	quest.A8B0C4B093997987.title: "Automation Limits and No-Free Loops"
	quest.A8B0C4B093997987.quest_desc: ["ProjectE can interact with farms, bees, seeds and machine recipes whose output EMC exceeds input. Such loops convert configuration mistakes into infinite matter.","Model every automated conversion, blacklist strategic outputs, include energy and catalysts and reject any positive closed loop without a deliberate sink."]
	quest.FA8669C41598E63E.title: "Project: Audited Transmutation Cell"
	quest.FA8669C41598E63E.quest_desc: ["Build a contained ProjectE cell with explicit EMC sources, bounded storage, approved targets and no connection to progression-gated items.","The project passes after an EMC input-output audit, zero-value verification for every gate, loss-safe shutdown and proof that no closed loop creates net matter."]
	quest.AECFC3F299DF2C3A.title: "Essence Tiers and Conversion"
	quest.AECFC3F299DF2C3A.quest_desc: ["Essence tiers compress large amounts of Inferium into recurring progression materials. Conversion ratios define the real farm demand.","Automate upward conversion, preserve lower tiers for recipes, expose stock by tier and avoid consuming the last master infusion component."]
	quest.2633DDA42E2F7DF1.title: "Infusion Altar as a Stage Gate"
	quest.2633DDA42E2F7DF1.quest_desc: ["The Infusion Altar unlocks seed creation and therefore renewable access to many resources. Its recipe is a major progression decision.","Require the industrial frame and bioprocess control, prevent loot or EMC access and treat every seed recipe as a resource-policy entry."]
	quest.8C318642FE80BEF0.title: "Seed Tiers and Resource Permissions"
	quest.8C318642FE80BEF0.quest_desc: ["A seed is not merely another crop; it grants permanent renewable production of its material. Seed availability must match the material progression stage.","Classify every seed, block late ores and boss materials, require stage components and audit add-ons that introduce duplicate seed paths."]
	quest.094801348F01F43F.title: "Farmland, Growth and Soil Policy"
	quest.094801348F01F43F.quest_desc: ["Farmland tier affects growth and consumes essence that competes with seed progression. Maximum soil everywhere is not always the best allocation.","Measure output per essence invested, reserve upgrade materials and assign high-tier soil to bottleneck crops instead of low-value bulk production."]
	quest.3AD6449BB8FE1362.title: "Growth Accelerators and Tick Cost"
	quest.3AD6449BB8FE1362.quest_desc: ["Growth accelerators stack vertically and increase crop update work. Large arrays can move the bottleneck from crop time to harvesting, storage or server ticks.","Scale in measured steps, verify collector capacity, keep chunk impact visible and prefer balanced farms over one uncontrolled tower."]
	quest.867111A33B980D7B.title: "Harvesting and Replanting"
	quest.867111A33B980D7B.quest_desc: ["Automated harvesting must preserve crops or seeds, collect every essence and stop before item entities or storage overflow accumulate.","Test replant behavior, route seeds and essence separately, provide overflow shutdown and verify the farm recovers when storage becomes available again."]
	quest.97189F1D45856512.title: "Secondary Drops and Recycling"
	quest.97189F1D45856512.quest_desc: ["Seeds, fertilized essence and add-on drops can become useful inputs or uncontrolled clutter. Deleting them may waste a balancing resource.","Assign every secondary output, recycle only through bounded recipes and prevent feedback loops that multiply essence or seeds without external cost."]
	quest.31D5098A06F15F4C.title: "Gear, Augments and Capability Jumps"
	quest.31D5098A06F15F4C.quest_desc: ["Essence gear can grant flight, area mining, strength and other capability jumps independent of the seed economy.","Gate augments by equivalent technology stages, separate farming progression from combat permissions and audit salvaging or upgrade paths."]
	quest.A471D119C4C21596.title: "Anti-Loop Resource Policy"
	quest.A471D119C4C21596.quest_desc: ["Crop outputs can feed ProjectE, bees, machines or seed crafting and create positive loops that duplicate matter or progression components.","Compare all conversions, set EMC zero on gates, block seeds for permissions and require a real external cost for every renewable late resource."]
	quest.5C7523EBFF6FF0CC.title: "Project: Stage-Safe Essence Farm"
	quest.5C7523EBFF6FF0CC.quest_desc: ["Build a farm that produces several approved materials, converts essence tiers and handles every secondary output without generating a locked resource.","The project passes after two harvest cycles, measured tick and storage capacity, overflow shutdown and a documented seed-permission audit."]
	chapter.5F76759A262F5635.title: "Core Technology Manual VII"
	quest.24263DE6662F6358.title: "Unique Encounters and Habitat"
	quest.24263DE6662F6358.quest_desc: ["Mowzie's Mobs uses rare creatures and bosses with distinct habitats, arenas and behavior rather than a single linear dimension.","Document where each encounter belongs, prepare a safe approach and keep first discovery and victory outside generic spawn or simulation systems."]
	quest.6B243BE2A0BCAFAD.title: "Ferrous Wroughtnaut: Armor Windows"
	quest.6B243BE2A0BCAFAD.quest_desc: ["The Wroughtnaut punishes frontal damage and rewards reading attack recovery and vulnerable positioning. Raw damage cannot replace pattern recognition reliably.","Observe a full attack cycle, preserve movement space, define a retreat route and avoid trapping the boss in geometry that removes its intended armor mechanic."]
	quest.D9E0CB0D80E50AB0.title: "Frostmaw: Wake Conditions and Freeze Control"
	quest.D9E0CB0D80E50AB0.quest_desc: ["Frostmaw combines dormant positioning, sudden activation, freezing attacks and high area pressure.","Prepare cold and movement responses, choose a clear arena, keep recovery gear outside activation range and do not use ranged terrain exploits that remove retaliation entirely."]
	quest.3EA606DD585F83DB.title: "Barakoa Groups and Mask Effects"
	quest.3EA606DD585F83DB.quest_desc: ["Barakoa encounters combine groups, ranged pressure and mask-based rewards. Farming ordinary tribes must not substitute for the Barako progression encounter.","Separate group control from boss preparation, classify mask capabilities by stage and prevent generic mob farms from producing unique leadership rewards."]
	quest.19AF639E68965CCB.title: "Sculptor Challenge and Movement Mastery"
	quest.19AF639E68965CCB.quest_desc: ["The Sculptor challenge tests movement, timing and route execution rather than conventional combat statistics.","Use the intended traversal tools, record failure points, keep a recovery route and prevent flight or teleport capabilities from invalidating the first legitimate completion."]
	quest.8AA41C7CB1FE5492.title: "Unique Drops and Capability Mapping"
	quest.8AA41C7CB1FE5492.quest_desc: ["Mowzie rewards often grant distinctive combat or movement capability. A quest reward, trade or simulator copy can bypass the encounter and its learning objective.","Assign every unique item to a stage, set zero EMC where needed, exclude it from generic farms and preserve repair or replacement materials."]
	quest.4A32050AA2BFBAF4.title: "Rematches and Repeat Materials"
	quest.4A32050AA2BFBAF4.quest_desc: ["Some rewards or crafting materials may need more than one encounter. Repeating a mastered fight can be fair; repeating rare discovery without control is not.","After first victory, provide a bounded rematch method with real cost, keep unique permissions non-consumable and prohibit unattended boss killing."]
	quest.185ED5D25D4BAB42.title: "Combat Scaling and Mechanic Preservation"
	quest.185ED5D25D4BAB42.quest_desc: ["Mowzie bosses use increased health, damage, armor and knockback resistance, but their designed vulnerability windows must remain the primary solution.","Model TTK, test phase duration and adjust the full attribute profile without making ordinary groups or mechanically invulnerable phases into health sponges."]
	quest.FC18FA1096BE153A.title: "Boss Simulation and Spawn Exclusion"
	quest.FC18FA1096BE153A.quest_desc: ["Neural models, Woot, swabs, spawner modifiers and generic grinders can attempt to automate Mowzie encounters or unique drops.","Blacklist bosses and signature rewards, allow ordinary creature drops only after review and keep first-victory evidence outside every simulation system."]
	quest.2FF9CF4376515C53.title: "Project: Documented Mowzie Encounter"
	quest.2FF9CF4376515C53.quest_desc: ["Complete one major Mowzie encounter with prepared recovery, recorded mechanics, preserved unique drops and no geometry or capability skip.","The project passes after successful return, modeled and observed fight duration, anti-farm verification and a fair rematch plan if repeat materials are justified."]
	quest.45F0C3230F463D80.title: "Mutant Threat Classification"
	quest.45F0C3230F463D80.quest_desc: ["Mutant Monsters turns familiar hostile mobs into elite encounters with new movement, attacks, health and death behavior.","Treat each mutant as an elite tier, prepare outside ordinary mob-farm assumptions and document spawn or conversion paths before allowing repeat encounters."]
	quest.9443DD6D6E1F8286.title: "Chemical X and Controlled Conversion"
	quest.9443DD6D6E1F8286.quest_desc: ["Chemical X turns an ordinary entity into a potential mutant and therefore converts a common spawn into an elite reward path.","Gate production by combat stage, contain conversion attempts, prevent automated mass use and verify failure outcomes cannot duplicate the chemical or mutant drops."]
	quest.A71A1D6D4E96919F.title: "Arena Space and Environmental Damage"
	quest.A71A1D6D4E96919F.quest_desc: ["Mutants use leaps, grabs, projectiles, shockwaves or explosions that punish cramped rooms and fragile nearby infrastructure.","Choose a clear controlled area, protect only recovery storage, preserve retreat lanes and avoid cages that remove the creature's intended movement."]
	quest.89ECCE2A060D499B.title: "Death Phases and False Victory"
	quest.89ECCE2A060D499B.quest_desc: ["Some mutants continue attacking, split, revive or create a final hazard after reaching zero health. Looting too early can turn apparent victory into item loss.","Learn the complete death sequence, keep distance until the encounter is finished and collect drops only after the arena is stable."]
	quest.20F5333FA840A2B0.title: "Mutant Drops and Capability Mapping"
	quest.20F5333FA840A2B0.quest_desc: ["Mutant drops and equipment can provide mobility, protection, summoning or utility beyond normal mob loot.","Assign every unique drop to a stage, keep zero EMC where necessary and prevent ordinary mob farms, trades or quest rewards from granting the same capability."]
	quest.2B2153D473D0115E.title: "Elite Scaling and Ordinary Caves"
	quest.2B2153D473D0115E.quest_desc: ["Mutants receive a stronger combat profile than common hostiles. Spawn frequency must remain low enough that ordinary exploration is dangerous but not permanently blocked.","Model hits and incoming damage, inspect encounter frequency and tune attributes together instead of solving every balance problem with health."]
	quest.B2B831ACDCAC3369.title: "Minions, Summons and Ownership"
	quest.B2B831ACDCAC3369.quest_desc: ["Certain mutant rewards create controllable minions or persistent entities. Ownership and population can become a hidden combat or tick advantage.","Cap active summons, document owner, provide dismissal and prevent automated creation from replacing normal defense or worker systems."]
	quest.2DCD004259CE3BB2.title: "Mutant Farm and Capture Exclusion"
	quest.2DCD004259CE3BB2.quest_desc: ["Swabs, powered spawners, Woot and neural simulation can turn a mutant into an unattended loot source.","Block direct simulation of unique mutants, allow only reviewed ordinary secondary drops and preserve real elite encounters for capability-defining rewards."]
	quest.55E67C3B20E96888.title: "Encounter Diagnostics and Recovery"
	quest.55E67C3B20E96888.quest_desc: ["A failed mutant encounter should be reviewed by conversion state, arena geometry, attack pattern, equipment durability, retreat route and death phase.","Change one preparation variable, keep replacement gear outside the area and repeat only after the actual mechanical cause is identified."]
	quest.1DBBEFE24B3F13AF.title: "Project: Controlled Mutant Encounter"
	quest.1DBBEFE24B3F13AF.quest_desc: ["Create or locate one stage-approved mutant, complete the encounter without capture or terrain cheese and classify every resulting item.","The project passes after full death-sequence verification, safe recovery, measured combat profile and proof that unique drops cannot enter unattended farm or simulation paths."]
	quest.E8466C0BE4BF1046.title: "Overworld Ecology and Encounter Mapping"
	quest.E8466C0BE4BF1046.quest_desc: ["Earth Mobs distributes Minecraft Earth-inspired creatures across ordinary Overworld biomes, so the first task is learning habitat and behavior rather than entering a separate dimension.","Record where passive, neutral and hostile variants appear, preserve natural spawn conditions, and do not use generic capture tools to replace the first legitimate encounter."]
	quest.384E0CE1182180CE.title: "Passive Variants and Useful Husbandry"
	quest.384E0CE1182180CE.quest_desc: ["Decorative or productive animal variants should enrich farms without becoming an unexplained source of late materials or bypassing another mod's breeding progression.","Separate cosmetic value from resource value, document breeding conditions and drops, and cap any output that competes with gated agriculture or industrial processing."]
	quest.0FF43E8C66F31CE6.title: "Hostile Variants and Threat Recognition"
	quest.0FF43E8C66F31CE6.quest_desc: ["Earth Mobs adds hostile variants whose movement, ranged pressure or special attacks differ from familiar vanilla enemies even when their silhouette appears recognizable.","Observe one full attack cycle, classify the threat before committing, maintain an open retreat route, and tune health and damage without hiding the distinguishing mechanic."]
	quest.B1C90116E0A98F33.title: "Boulderer: Vertical Pressure and Terrain"
	quest.B1C90116E0A98F33.quest_desc: ["The climbing Boulderer changes the safety assumptions of cliffs, walls and elevated firing positions because vertical terrain no longer guarantees separation.","Test approach routes on natural terrain, avoid one-block geometry exploits, protect recovery storage outside the combat area, and keep the encounter readable after scaling."]
	quest.FD6785678645BB46.title: "Viler Witch: Effects, Adds and Area Control"
	quest.FD6785678645BB46.quest_desc: ["The Viler Witch represents an encounter where status effects and battlefield control can be more dangerous than direct damage, especially when ordinary mobs join the fight.","Carry effect removal and ranged options, isolate supporting enemies, mark safe recovery distance, and prevent automated farms from trivializing distinctive drops."]
	quest.6F10AD3B9AD9D38C.title: "Drop Classification and Progression Value"
	quest.6F10AD3B9AD9D38C.quest_desc: ["Every new mob drop must be classified as cosmetic, common utility, renewable material or capability-defining reward before it can enter storage, trade and automation systems.","Assign a stage, set EMC and simulation policy explicitly, remove inappropriate quest rewards, and keep unique combat rewards tied to a legitimate encounter."]
	quest.604D964E68DE2A77.title: "Capture, Transport and Spawn Controls"
	quest.604D964E68DE2A77.quest_desc: ["Mob transport tools can turn a rare ecological encounter into unlimited production or place a dangerous creature inside geometry where its behavior no longer functions.","Allow transport only after first documentation, blacklist elite or unique entities from duplication paths, and require safe enclosures that preserve intended movement."]
	quest.A91891737053AFAC.title: "Fair Farms and Output Boundaries"
	quest.A91891737053AFAC.quest_desc: ["Ordinary Earth Mobs resources may become renewable after review, but a farm must not outperform dedicated progression machines or generate unique encounter rewards unattended.","Measure output per hour, include spawn and transport cost, stop cleanly when storage fills, and blacklist any reward that grants a new capability or stage permission."]
	quest.1198764BC4E85030.title: "Encounter Diagnostics and Scaling Review"
	quest.1198764BC4E85030.quest_desc: ["When an encounter feels unfair, separate spawn frequency, terrain, status effects, group size, health, armor and damage instead of changing a single global multiplier.","Reproduce the same scenario, change one variable, compare theoretical and observed outcomes, and preserve the mob's recognizable behavior as the primary challenge."]
	quest.9BF3ADD2175BC4CE.title: "Project: Earth Mobs Field Catalogue"
	quest.9BF3ADD2175BC4CE.quest_desc: ["Document representative passive, neutral and hostile Earth Mobs encounters with habitat, behavior, drops, stage value, capture policy and a safe recovery procedure.","The project passes when every sampled output has an explicit automation rule and no unique or elite reward can be obtained through an unattended generic system."]
	quest.A4161DDE65C96DBE.title: "Chaotic Threat Ecology"
	quest.A4161DDE65C96DBE.quest_desc: ["Born in Chaos adds many aggressive creatures with distinct attacks and places them into ordinary survival, caves, structures and travel routes rather than isolating danger in one arena.","Classify threats by environment and stage, identify escape conditions before combat, and avoid spawn settings that turn routine travel into an unavoidable chain of elite fights."]
	quest.8DDC3087575E8216.title: "Structures, Approach and Loot Security"
	quest.8DDC3087575E8216.quest_desc: ["Mod structures combine hostile density, confined geometry and valuable equipment, so entering from a safe angle or breaking walls can remove much of the intended risk.","Define a legitimate entry rule, preserve key encounter spaces, place recovery storage outside the structure, and audit every chest reward against the progression stage."]
	quest.794C92309A931D32.title: "Special Attacks and Defensive Responses"
	quest.794C92309A931D32.quest_desc: ["Many Born in Chaos enemies use unusual movement, control, ranged attacks or status effects that invalidate a single universal defense strategy.","Observe the telegraph, match a specific response, maintain durability and consumable reserves, and tune raw damage only after the mechanical counter remains usable."]
	quest.8896564BF799DA0B.title: "Elite and Miniboss Classification"
	quest.8896564BF799DA0B.quest_desc: ["Elite creatures and minibosses should sit above ordinary hostile profiles without appearing so frequently that early exploration becomes statistically impossible.","Separate spawn rarity from combat power, define equipment expectations, keep unique rewards outside generic farms and provide a deliberate rematch path only after first victory."]
	quest.57C4BA432DDF28E8.title: "Equipment, Effects and Capability Tiers"
	quest.57C4BA432DDF28E8.quest_desc: ["Born in Chaos equipment may combine combat statistics with special effects, so recipe price alone does not show the actual progression power of an item.","Evaluate mobility, crowd control, healing, summons and damage together, assign a stage, and close loot, reward, trade and repair paths that grant the capability early."]
	quest.6F77E3E3623C3C3C.title: "Conditional and Seasonal Content"
	quest.6F77E3E3623C3C3C.quest_desc: ["Conditional enemies or rewards must not become permanently inaccessible or force clock manipulation when they are required by the main progression.","Keep seasonal content optional or provide a bounded alternative after discovery, document activation conditions and prevent date changes from duplicating unique rewards."]
	quest.D06D87B1EF8CD2E5.title: "Spawn Density and Safe Infrastructure"
	quest.D06D87B1EF8CD2E5.quest_desc: ["A large hostile roster can compound with darkness, structures and other mob mods, creating density spikes that are more dangerous than any individual combat profile.","Measure simultaneous threats, preserve recoverable safe zones, cap elite clustering and tune spawn weights separately from health, armor and damage."]
	quest.5E80AB8F8F80FC65.title: "Capture, Spawner and Simulation Exclusion"
	quest.5E80AB8F8F80FC65.quest_desc: ["Swabs, powered spawners, Woot and neural simulation can convert rare or scripted Born in Chaos encounters into unattended loot production.","Blacklist elites, minibosses and capability-defining drops, review ordinary materials individually and require real first-victory evidence outside every automated system."]
	quest.5BFE011FF3E8A3A5.title: "Failure Analysis and Recovery Contract"
	quest.5BFE011FF3E8A3A5.quest_desc: ["Deaths in a dense hostile environment often come from combined effects, path blocking or durability collapse rather than the last visible attacker.","Record the full failure chain, keep a replacement kit outside the danger zone, change one preparation variable and confirm the route remains recoverable without repeated item loss."]
	quest.E852B0BEADC39D50.title: "Project: Controlled Chaos Expedition"
	quest.E852B0BEADC39D50.quest_desc: ["Complete one structure or elite route with a written threat map, stage-appropriate equipment, recovery cache and explicit classification of every unusual output.","The project passes when the route can be repeated without terrain cheese and no elite reward, conditional item or structure loot bypasses the declared progression."]
	quest.D735DDC7CA601D1F.title: "Weapon Families and Intended Roles"
	quest.D735DDC7CA601D1F.quest_desc: ["Simply Swords adds many weapon families such as spears, glaives, chakrams, katanas, heavy weapons and rapiers, each intended to trade reach, speed, area or handling differently.","Compare role rather than only tooltip damage, document attack cadence and reach, and prevent one family from replacing every early, mid and late combat choice."]
	quest.969295169F9A4415.title: "Attack Speed, Recovery and Real DPS"
	quest.969295169F9A4415.quest_desc: ["A slow heavy hit and a fast light sequence can show similar nominal damage while producing very different interruption risk, enchantment value and effective damage uptime.","Calculate full-cycle DPS, include missed attacks and recovery windows, then balance recipes by usable combat value rather than a single damage number."]
	quest.E3DFB3D79033E3EF.title: "Reach, Cleave and Positioning Power"
	quest.E3DFB3D79033E3EF.quest_desc: ["Extra reach, wide swings and projectile-like weapons can grant safety or crowd control whose value exceeds their direct damage, especially against enhanced mobs.","Test confined and open arenas, count targets controlled per action, and assign stage cost for positional advantage instead of compensating only with durability."]
	quest.3342BD7AD1861FA4.title: "Material Tiers and Cross-Mod Smithing"
	quest.3342BD7AD1861FA4.quest_desc: ["Large material compatibility can create a weapon from an ore or alloy earlier than the corresponding armor, machine or processing line was intended to unlock.","Tie each material family to its real production stage, remove alternative smithing shortcuts and keep repair ingredients subject to the same gate as the first craft."]
	quest.41254C79502EBB52.title: "Unique Weapons and Exploration Loot"
	quest.41254C79502EBB52.quest_desc: ["Simply Swords unique weapons can appear in exploration chests and may provide powerful abilities while being intentionally non-craftable.","Classify every unique by capability and stage, audit all injected loot tables, prohibit quest or trade duplication and provide only a fair replacement policy after legitimate discovery."]
	quest.A3FC968EC3F8452D.title: "Unique Effects and Capability Budget"
	quest.A3FC968EC3F8452D.quest_desc: ["Healing, execution thresholds, area effects, movement, elemental damage or crowd control can shift progression more than base attack statistics.","Evaluate the complete effect under boss and group conditions, set cooldown and acquisition expectations, and prevent stacking with other mods from creating an early dominant loop."]
	quest.0EAA3D8C2757301A.title: "Animation Compatibility and Hit Validation"
	quest.0EAA3D8C2757301A.quest_desc: ["When paired with combat animation overhauls, weapon families can gain different swing arcs and timing, so tooltip balance may not match actual hit coverage.","Validate representative attacks with the installed combat stack, check server authority and latency, and keep progression rules independent of a purely visual animation advantage."]
	quest.26C62F231A3068C5.title: "Enchanting, Repair and Lifetime Cost"
	quest.26C62F231A3068C5.quest_desc: ["A fair first craft can still become an early permanent advantage if repair, duplication or enchantment transfer ignores the material and stage that produced the weapon.","Gate repair inputs, review mending and salvage systems, prevent cheap copying of unique effects and evaluate lifetime cost instead of only initial ingredients."]
	quest.876A8C24A77EB3B7.title: "Boss TTK and Weapon Benchmarking"
	quest.876A8C24A77EB3B7.quest_desc: ["A diverse weapon pack needs benchmark roles at several progression stages so boss health is not tuned around one exceptional unique item or an unrealistic stationary target.","Measure active combat time, include mechanic downtime, compare several families and keep the strongest reward situational rather than universally optimal."]
	quest.F430CDEA5CA0B7ED.title: "Project: Comparative Weapon Trial"
	quest.F430CDEA5CA0B7ED.quest_desc: ["Select three different weapon families at the same material stage and compare reach, cycle damage, control, durability, repair cost and performance against one group and one elite.","The project passes when each family has a clear role, unique loot is stage-classified and no recipe, repair or loot path grants a later capability early."]
	quest.5BD6A7832E1C150E.title: "Runic Tablet — Source and Combat Acceptance"
	quest.5BD6A7832E1C150E.quest_desc: ["Runic Tablet is a progression material used by the Simply Swords acquisition or upgrade route. Its rarity must reflect the weapon tier it can unlock rather than becoming a random quest payout.","Acceptance: obtain it from the declared stage-approved source, record whether it is renewable, set loot/EMC/trade policy, and verify that no reward table or generic simulator can duplicate it early."]
	quest.5A702948C74D1AB4.title: "Runefused Gem — Source and Combat Acceptance"
	quest.5A702948C74D1AB4.quest_desc: ["Runefused Gem is a progression material used by the Simply Swords acquisition or upgrade route. Its rarity must reflect the weapon tier it can unlock rather than becoming a random quest payout.","Acceptance: obtain it from the declared stage-approved source, record whether it is renewable, set loot/EMC/trade policy, and verify that no reward table or generic simulator can duplicate it early."]
	quest.3E6E12AD370CF35A.title: "Netherfused Gem — Source and Combat Acceptance"
	quest.3E6E12AD370CF35A.quest_desc: ["Netherfused Gem is a progression material used by the Simply Swords acquisition or upgrade route. Its rarity must reflect the weapon tier it can unlock rather than becoming a random quest payout.","Acceptance: obtain it from the declared stage-approved source, record whether it is renewable, set loot/EMC/trade policy, and verify that no reward table or generic simulator can duplicate it early."]
	quest.7141F24D5C64641E.title: "Empowered Remnant — Source and Combat Acceptance"
	quest.7141F24D5C64641E.quest_desc: ["Empowered Remnant is a progression material used by the Simply Swords acquisition or upgrade route. Its rarity must reflect the weapon tier it can unlock rather than becoming a random quest payout.","Acceptance: obtain it from the declared stage-approved source, record whether it is renewable, set loot/EMC/trade policy, and verify that no reward table or generic simulator can duplicate it early."]
	quest.5DB892ED84E0ACE1.title: "Brimstone Claymore — Source and Combat Acceptance"
	quest.5DB892ED84E0ACE1.quest_desc: ["Brimstone Claymore is a heavy weapon. Treat fire and damage-over-time effects as progression power, not as a cosmetic variant; read the actual tooltip and test the complete attack cycle before comparing raw damage.","Acceptance: obtain the weapon through its approved source, record speed, reach, effect trigger, cooldown, durability and repair path, then prove that quests, trades, loot duplication and mob simulation cannot grant it before its stage."]
	quest.3DDFF63B6A512472.title: "Watcher Claymore — Source and Combat Acceptance"
	quest.3DDFF63B6A512472.quest_desc: ["Watcher Claymore is a heavy weapon. Treat soul, execution or sustain effects as progression power, not as a cosmetic variant; read the actual tooltip and test the complete attack cycle before comparing raw damage.","Acceptance: obtain the weapon through its approved source, record speed, reach, effect trigger, cooldown, durability and repair path, then prove that quests, trades, loot duplication and mob simulation cannot grant it before its stage."]
	quest.71DE830777DAE815.title: "Storms Edge — Source and Combat Acceptance"
	quest.71DE830777DAE815.quest_desc: ["Storms Edge is a unique weapon. Treat storm and area-pressure effects as progression power, not as a cosmetic variant; read the actual tooltip and test the complete attack cycle before comparing raw damage.","Acceptance: obtain the weapon through its approved source, record speed, reach, effect trigger, cooldown, durability and repair path, then prove that quests, trades, loot duplication and mob simulation cannot grant it before its stage."]
